(1601358, 215923, 39675, '<td valign="top">I''m scorig you quite low for a few reasons.  Please take these reasons as a representation of how to please or not please one voter (maybe more if I''m the only one willing to comment)  One I have no idea what year you are portraying (by looking at the picture.  Although you say "now" in your title, now is not a year and the hands on a clock have been around for a long time, which leads me to... Two, this clock is not something that would do well in a time capsule.  It is like you are submitting a photograph to a corporate client hoping they will use your photo in their adds.  They ask for a picture the distiguishes which a specific year.  Would they select your photo over others.  No.</td>', 'I''m scorig you quite low for a few reasons.  Please take these reasons as a representation of how to please or not please one voter (maybe more if I''m the only one willing to comment)  One I have no idea what year you are portraying (by looking at the picture.  Although you say "now" in your title, now is not a year and the hands on a clock have been around for a long time, which leads me to... Two, this clock is not something that would do well in a time capsule.  It is like you are submitting a photograph to a corporate client hoping they will use your photo in their adds.  They ask for a picture the distiguishes which a specific year.  Would they select your photo over others.  No.', '2005-08-10 14:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1601359, 215245, 30061, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot...I love the angle of the sun on the wood. 8</td>', 'Lovely shot...I love the angle of the sun on the wood. 8', '2005-08-10 14:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1601360, 216026, 23107, '<td valign="top">I think this is a bit bright.  Maybe desaturate it a little.</td>', 'I think this is a bit bright.  Maybe desaturate it a little.', '2005-08-10 14:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1601361, 213371, 41787, '<td valign="top">This looks great, good use of sepia tone. authentic looking</td>', 'This looks great, good use of sepia tone. authentic looking', '2005-08-10 14:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1601364, 215020, 30061, '<td valign="top">I think this would actually work better with a different year - one in which farming and cattle were more important to the nation than they are today.  Farmers struggle so much these days that this seems more fitted to years past than years present.<br/> <br/>Title aside, I love the simplicity of the shot, the gorgeous clear blue sky, and the focus on the cow.  Good colors and composition.  Great shot!  9</td>', 'I think this would actually work better with a different year - one in which farming and cattle were more important to the nation than they are today.  Farmers struggle so much these days that this seems more fitted to years past than years present. Title aside, I love the simplicity of the shot, the gorgeous clear blue sky, and the focus on the cow.  Good colors and composition.  Great shot!  9', '2005-08-10 14:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1601367, 214974, 23107, '<td valign="top">I think you got a lot of good elements here.  Try retaking this shot angled so you can see the needle clearly, still read the record title and facing the arm so the arm goes out of focus into the background.</td>', 'I think you got a lot of good elements here.  Try retaking this shot angled so you can see the needle clearly, still read the record title and facing the arm so the arm goes out of focus into the background.', '2005-08-10 14:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1601369, 215224, 41787, '<td valign="top">just seems like too much going on. My eyes cant focus, maybe its the blur. Good idea though</td>', 'just seems like too much going on. My eyes cant focus, maybe its the blur. Good idea though', '2005-08-10 14:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1601371, 214366, 30061, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  My one complaint is the noise - while I think you probably used it to make the photo appear that it was taken in 1960 (which is a good idea in theory), as someone who''s used the noise filter in Photoshop before, it looks very uniform and digitally added to me.  Great shot though! 7</td>', 'I really like this shot.  My one complaint is the noise - while I think you probably used it to make the photo appear that it was taken in 1960 (which is a good idea in theory), as someone who''s used the noise filter in Photoshop before, it looks very uniform and digitally added to me.  Great shot though! 7', '2005-08-10 14:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1601373, 214271, 41787, '<td valign="top">love the mood, and the color tone. Please let us know how you did this</td>', 'love the mood, and the color tone. Please let us know how you did this', '2005-08-10 14:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
