(1601637, 214563, 39349, '<td valign="top">Great capture, like the b/w. I almost think that the DOF hurts a bit in this photo, I wonder how it would look with the trees in the background a bit out of focus?</td>', 'Great capture, like the b/w. I almost think that the DOF hurts a bit in this photo, I wonder how it would look with the trees in the background a bit out of focus?', '2005-08-10 16:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1601639, 214074, 26679, '<td valign="top">if I recall the renaissance period was fron the middle of the 15th century to the end of the 16 century. Pocket watches only came into use from the 17th century...<br/> <br/>That being said the idea is interesting, and a less slightly sharper focus would really lift this image.</td>', 'if I recall the renaissance period was fron the middle of the 15th century to the end of the 16 century. Pocket watches only came into use from the 17th century... That being said the idea is interesting, and a less slightly sharper focus would really lift this image.', '2005-08-10 16:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1601641, 215785, 39349, '<td valign="top">Like the sepia tones here, and the grain adds a nostalgic feeling to this photo. One of only two baseball themes in the challenge! Good job and good luck! ;-)</td>', 'Like the sepia tones here, and the grain adds a nostalgic feeling to this photo. One of only two baseball themes in the challenge! Good job and good luck! ;-)', '2005-08-10 16:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
