(1601977, 215172, 16488, '<td valign="top">Clever use of desaturation.  Interesting composition.  The textures are appealing.  However, the reflective white bits in the near rocks detract from the potential this image had to make a great impact--easily remedied in advanced editing, but incurable under the basic rules.</td>', 'Clever use of desaturation.  Interesting composition.  The textures are appealing.  However, the reflective white bits in the near rocks detract from the potential this image had to make a great impact--easily remedied in advanced editing, but incurable under the basic rules.', '2005-08-10 18:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
