(1601988, 216011, 30061, '<td valign="top">This will probably score high, I think.  Great job capturing the feel of the 50s. 8</td>', 'This will probably score high, I think.  Great job capturing the feel of the 50s. 8', '2005-08-10 18:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1601989, 215699, 3032, '<td valign="top">Simply excellent. Subject &amp; light, is so good. The bits of mist make it work. You can just feel the start of a hard, but rewarding, day in the fields.<br/>Graduated warming ND?<br/></td>', 'Simply excellent. Subject & light, is so good. The bits of mist make it work. You can just feel the start of a hard, but rewarding, day in the fields.Graduated warming ND?', '2005-08-10 18:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1601994, 214798, 30061, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.  Great depth of field; love the sepia tone.  One of my favorites.  10</td>', 'Beautifully done.  Great depth of field; love the sepia tone.  One of my favorites.  10', '2005-08-10 18:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602000, 214810, 3032, '<td valign="top">The way the motion blur works here makes the phot very special, timeless. One of two 10''s in this challenge.</td>', 'The way the motion blur works here makes the phot very special, timeless. One of two 10''s in this challenge.', '2005-08-10 18:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602003, 214125, 30061, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  I would have liked a thin frame around this, but even still it''s beautiful.  One of my favorites - 10!</td>', 'Gorgeous.  I would have liked a thin frame around this, but even still it''s beautiful.  One of my favorites - 10!', '2005-08-10 18:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602008, 214516, 3032, '<td valign="top">It is very clear and sharp for that time, but the person in this frame is what makes it work.<br/>Interesting undistorted wide view, nice toning. A tie for third place for me.</td>', 'It is very clear and sharp for that time, but the person in this frame is what makes it work.Interesting undistorted wide view, nice toning. A tie for third place for me.', '2005-08-10 18:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602009, 216078, 16488, '<td valign="top">The tones are lovely in this photo....it''s not always easy to render such a convincing black and white using digital.<br/>Unfortunately, the reflective strips interrupt the "dream" of it being anything older than last year''s model of an Amish buggy.<br/>I can understand why you didn''t want to crop out that appealing little door in the side of the barn, but that choice has left your main subject dead center sapping the energy out of the wide-angle view.</td>', 'The tones are lovely in this photo....it''s not always easy to render such a convincing black and white using digital.Unfortunately, the reflective strips interrupt the "dream" of it being anything older than last year''s model of an Amish buggy.I can understand why you didn''t want to crop out that appealing little door in the side of the barn, but that choice has left your main subject dead center sapping the energy out of the wide-angle view.', '2005-08-10 18:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602010, 215661, 30061, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, but the photo is much too blurry and grainy for me to focus on anything very well.</td>', 'Nice subject, but the photo is much too blurry and grainy for me to focus on anything very well.', '2005-08-10 18:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602012, 216097, 30208, '<td valign="top">Could have used better lighting.  The front lips are a little dark. It would have helped bring out the color that is there.</td>', 'Could have used better lighting.  The front lips are a little dark. It would have helped bring out the color that is there.', '2005-08-10 18:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602015, 214995, 3032, '<td valign="top">All the telling elements are present, the top of the standard tells even more then the flag does. It is a bit bright, what doesn''t correspond with such a hard battle (where one thinks of dark hard contrast exposures). Nevertheless a great shot, one of three nines in this challenge and therefore a tie for third place imo.</td>', 'All the telling elements are present, the top of the standard tells even more then the flag does. It is a bit bright, what doesn''t correspond with such a hard battle (where one thinks of dark hard contrast exposures). Nevertheless a great shot, one of three nines in this challenge and therefore a tie for third place imo.', '2005-08-10 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602019, 214770, 16488, '<td valign="top">Lovely use of monochromatic tones--don''t pay any attention to those disturbed by the yellow sky....just pick up a copy of the short story "The Yellow Wallpaper" or read a bit of T.S. Elliott''s poem about the yellow smoke wending its way through the industrial alleys of town and you''ll quickly ignore your detractors.<br/>Only pitty here, for me, is the street signs.  I don''t think you would have lost much by cropping in 1/6th from the right.</td>', 'Lovely use of monochromatic tones--don''t pay any attention to those disturbed by the yellow sky....just pick up a copy of the short story "The Yellow Wallpaper" or read a bit of T.S. Elliott''s poem about the yellow smoke wending its way through the industrial alleys of town and you''ll quickly ignore your detractors.Only pitty here, for me, is the street signs.  I don''t think you would have lost much by cropping in 1/6th from the right.', '2005-08-10 18:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602020, 213464, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great color, the gradation from the dark foreground to the bright tents and gradation in the mountains combined with the great color is very good. Love the sky with the rain vs the bright background.</td>', 'Great color, the gradation from the dark foreground to the bright tents and gradation in the mountains combined with the great color is very good. Love the sky with the rain vs the bright background.', '2005-08-10 18:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602021, 214810, 41522, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!  I reall like the motion.  A little more of the chariot would have been nice.</td>', 'Excellent shot!  I reall like the motion.  A little more of the chariot would have been nice.', '2005-08-10 18:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602023, 216142, 41522, '<td valign="top">Is this Howdy Doody?  Excellent Lighting and I really like the strings.</td>', 'Is this Howdy Doody?  Excellent Lighting and I really like the strings.', '2005-08-10 18:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602029, 216190, 16488, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a projector!<br/>Prudent use of the star filter.<br/>Lovely rendering of light on the textured surfaces.<br/>The only drawback for this challenge is that one really has to know what they''re looking at--wouldn''t expect someone opening a time capsule to get it.</td>', 'Now that''s a projector!Prudent use of the star filter.Lovely rendering of light on the textured surfaces.The only drawback for this challenge is that one really has to know what they''re looking at--wouldn''t expect someone opening a time capsule to get it.', '2005-08-10 18:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602030, 213248, 41522, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I don''t see how this relates to the era of 2005.  Flooding happens every year somewhere.</td>', 'I''m sorry, I don''t see how this relates to the era of 2005.  Flooding happens every year somewhere.', '2005-08-10 18:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602033, 214054, 3032, '<td valign="top">The subject and presentation is very interesting, but I don''t see how the warm orange tone works with it. 7</td>', 'The subject and presentation is very interesting, but I don''t see how the warm orange tone works with it. 7', '2005-08-10 18:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602035, 215336, 34255, '<td valign="top">I''d like it better if she had a solemn expression on her face.</td>', 'I''d like it better if she had a solemn expression on her face.', '2005-08-10 18:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602039, 215244, 41522, '<td valign="top">The One Way sign along with the cross walk signal really detract from this otherwise okay photo.</td>', 'The One Way sign along with the cross walk signal really detract from this otherwise okay photo.', '2005-08-10 18:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602040, 214770, 3032, '<td valign="top">I don''t think America was built on industry, but more on a determination, confidence and believe in themselves.<br/>The bright yellow toning and contrast is interesting. The compotion works well, apart from the fact that the lines lead me to the bottem middle of the frame and shows nothing special there. 7</td>', 'I don''t think America was built on industry, but more on a determination, confidence and believe in themselves.The bright yellow toning and contrast is interesting. The compotion works well, apart from the fact that the lines lead me to the bottem middle of the frame and shows nothing special there. 7', '2005-08-10 18:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602043, 213371, 30061, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, nice tones.  I wish the tower was straighter - as it is, it leans slightly to the right, which is somewhat distracting.</td>', 'Nice shot, nice tones.  I wish the tower was straighter - as it is, it leans slightly to the right, which is somewhat distracting.', '2005-08-10 18:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602045, 214206, 3032, '<td valign="top">Contrast and exposure/light works magically here. Who cares about the blown highligjts it''s all about the subject hanging out of the window. Good job.</td>', 'Contrast and exposure/light works magically here. Who cares about the blown highligjts it''s all about the subject hanging out of the window. Good job.', '2005-08-10 18:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602048, 213895, 41522, '<td valign="top">I get it .... and the photo is very nice.</td>', 'I get it .... and the photo is very nice.', '2005-08-10 18:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602049, 216019, 30061, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous view!  I''ve always loved old ruins - and these are not only old, but beautiful.  The rainbow is a lovely touch.  9</td>', 'Gorgeous view!  I''ve always loved old ruins - and these are not only old, but beautiful.  The rainbow is a lovely touch.  9', '2005-08-10 18:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602050, 215706, 3032, '<td valign="top">The end of the best time in architecture?<br/>Great composition, the tone fits the ambiance of the time.</td>', 'The end of the best time in architecture?Great composition, the tone fits the ambiance of the time.', '2005-08-10 18:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602055, 214702, 3032, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I can picturel it. Well done.</td>', 'Yeah, I can picturel it. Well done.', '2005-08-10 18:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602056, 214467, 41522, '<td valign="top">I think this shot could be for that time frame.  The modern cars and modern dress take away from the time period.  Maybe a closeup of the neon would have worked better and been a little more artistic.</td>', 'I think this shot could be for that time frame.  The modern cars and modern dress take away from the time period.  Maybe a closeup of the neon would have worked better and been a little more artistic.', '2005-08-10 18:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602057, 215372, 41522, '<td valign="top">The photo does seem to match the challenge.  The scene looks nice, but the dynamic range of the scene could have been managed better, perhaps with grad. ND filters.  The detailsin the sky would have been stronger.</td>', 'The photo does seem to match the challenge.  The scene looks nice, but the dynamic range of the scene could have been managed better, perhaps with grad. ND filters.  The detailsin the sky would have been stronger.', '2005-08-10 18:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602066, 215960, 41554, '<td valign="top">Perhaps it would look better at sunrise... the colours are a bit "weird" IMHO.</td>', 'Perhaps it would look better at sunrise... the colours are a bit "weird" IMHO.', '2005-08-10 18:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602070, 214125, 3032, '<td valign="top">Interesting B&amp;W conversion, heavy read filtering (negative blue in the channel mixer)? Almost near infrared on the greens. Great sky, I''ve been searching for that sky for four days but the crappy weather in our country didn''t cooperate. :(<br/> <br/>The mood is a bit dark, but I like it a lot. Would have liked to see some sails on the wings, it would bring out the windmill a lot better agains the sky.</td>', 'Interesting B&W conversion, heavy read filtering (negative blue in the channel mixer)? Almost near infrared on the greens. Great sky, I''ve been searching for that sky for four days but the crappy weather in our country didn''t cooperate. :( The mood is a bit dark, but I like it a lot. Would have liked to see some sails on the wings, it would bring out the windmill a lot better agains the sky.', '2005-08-10 18:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602074, 214193, 41522, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure how this photo "depicts an era in time."  In addition, the flower is over-exposed as evidenced by the blown out areas on the petals of the flower.  The harsh light really makes it difficult to get a good flower photo.</td>', 'I''m not really sure how this photo "depicts an era in time."  In addition, the flower is over-exposed as evidenced by the blown out areas on the petals of the flower.  The harsh light really makes it difficult to get a good flower photo.', '2005-08-10 18:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602075, 215970, 3032, '<td valign="top">The idea is good, very Madonna.<br/>The background spoils it a bit, sloppy and dirty grey while the subject is exposed hot (near overexposure). Some work on the background (pastel tint to fit the time) without creases and more balanced light on the girl would make it work better.<br/>The border would work better with hard straight lines, the eighties favoured that presentation.</td>', 'The idea is good, very Madonna.The background spoils it a bit, sloppy and dirty grey while the subject is exposed hot (near overexposure). Some work on the background (pastel tint to fit the time) without creases and more balanced light on the girl would make it work better.The border would work better with hard straight lines, the eighties favoured that presentation.', '2005-08-10 18:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602079, 214236, 41522, '<td valign="top">Some nice memorabilia to take you back ...</td>', 'Some nice memorabilia to take you back ...', '2005-08-10 18:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602080, 214206, 30061, '<td valign="top">This looks like it belongs in a magazine.  My one complaint is the reflection in the car - it''s distracting to me.  Otherwise, great job!  8</td>', 'This looks like it belongs in a magazine.  My one complaint is the reflection in the car - it''s distracting to me.  Otherwise, great job!  8', '2005-08-10 18:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602082, 216110, 37961, '<td valign="top">The only thing that didnt do it for me in this photo were the modern garments.</td>', 'The only thing that didnt do it for me in this photo were the modern garments.', '2005-08-10 18:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602084, 216212, 30061, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what this actually is, which makes your title all the more confusing.  I''m usually a fan of black backgrounds for shots, but the subject here is blurry on the bottom left, and either there''s not enough of it showing for me to know what it is, or I''m being ignorant because I was only 2 years old in 1987. :o)</td>', 'I have no idea what this actually is, which makes your title all the more confusing.  I''m usually a fan of black backgrounds for shots, but the subject here is blurry on the bottom left, and either there''s not enough of it showing for me to know what it is, or I''m being ignorant because I was only 2 years old in 1987. :o)', '2005-08-10 18:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602086, 215301, 30061, '<td valign="top">Like the composition here, and the authentic feel of the shot.  I also like the framing.  Great shot, 9.</td>', 'Like the composition here, and the authentic feel of the shot.  I also like the framing.  Great shot, 9.', '2005-08-10 18:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602088, 214563, 30061, '<td valign="top">I can''t help but be glad that these were out of date by the time I was born.  :o)  Nice black &amp; white shot.</td>', 'I can''t help but be glad that these were out of date by the time I was born.  :o)  Nice black & white shot.', '2005-08-10 18:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602089, 216192, 41522, '<td valign="top">Good lighting.  Think of how hard it would be to go to the bathroom once you''re dressed in this thing.</td>', 'Good lighting.  Think of how hard it would be to go to the bathroom once you''re dressed in this thing.', '2005-08-10 18:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602091, 215614, 35804, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF...very slick...I like the lighting also...somehow it does have a nice "old photo" appeal to it.</td>', 'Nice DOF...very slick...I like the lighting also...somehow it does have a nice "old photo" appeal to it.', '2005-08-10 18:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602092, 215994, 41522, '<td valign="top">A good example of the art deco architecture.  I wish the top of the building had not been cut off.</td>', 'A good example of the art deco architecture.  I wish the top of the building had not been cut off.', '2005-08-10 18:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602093, 214505, 30061, '<td valign="top">The one thing that keeps this from looking authentic is the girl''s dress - the pattern seems much fancier than dresses would have been at the time.  Otherwise, nice shot.  I like the sepia.</td>', 'The one thing that keeps this from looking authentic is the girl''s dress - the pattern seems much fancier than dresses would have been at the time.  Otherwise, nice shot.  I like the sepia.', '2005-08-10 18:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
