(1602178, 215399, 35804, '<td valign="top">kool... those bikes and coke machines are great except back in 1954 they looked a whole lot newer...but perhaps he is from the wrong side of town... he''s no soc ( think The Outsiders)...this would totally rock if this were set against a cement wall, or brick...anything but that suburban lookin'' garage door.<br/> <br/>A second look...still really kool...I just love fifties stuff...and I forgot to give ya kudos on the slick pomp do...looks good and greeazy.<br/> <br/></td>', 'kool... those bikes and coke machines are great except back in 1954 they looked a whole lot newer...but perhaps he is from the wrong side of town... he''s no soc ( think The Outsiders)...this would totally rock if this were set against a cement wall, or brick...anything but that suburban lookin'' garage door. A second look...still really kool...I just love fifties stuff...and I forgot to give ya kudos on the slick pomp do...looks good and greeazy. ', '2005-08-10 19:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
