(1602427, 215301, 23107, '<td valign="top">The contrast with the ruins and people dressed emaculately for the period makes this picture feel goofy and out of place.</td>', 'The contrast with the ruins and people dressed emaculately for the period makes this picture feel goofy and out of place.', '2005-08-10 21:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602430, 214774, 23107, '<td valign="top">Took me a little while to understand this is a keyboard.  Might want to retake this shot so that it is more apparant that it is.  Very nice, very colorful.  Good find!</td>', 'Took me a little while to understand this is a keyboard.  Might want to retake this shot so that it is more apparant that it is.  Very nice, very colorful.  Good find!', '2005-08-10 21:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602443, 214206, 23107, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool.  The reflection in the car door is annoying tho.</td>', 'This is pretty cool.  The reflection in the car door is annoying tho.', '2005-08-10 21:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602444, 214008, 36050, '<td valign="top">The lighting it''s a little bit low, it makes the upper details of the car to loose.</td>', 'The lighting it''s a little bit low, it makes the upper details of the car to loose.', '2005-08-10 21:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602449, 215381, 36050, '<td valign="top">I liked the lighting effect out of the box, it looks like a treasure chest.</td>', 'I liked the lighting effect out of the box, it looks like a treasure chest.', '2005-08-10 21:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602453, 214364, 36050, '<td valign="top">The dressing is good, but the pose of the model it''s weird.</td>', 'The dressing is good, but the pose of the model it''s weird.', '2005-08-10 21:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602461, 214061, 31720, '<td valign="top">What event does this commemorate?  I''m not lowering your score; I''m just curious.<br/> <br/>With high-key photos like this one, you have to be careful to not let your subject''s boundaries get lost in the background.  Here, all of the statues edges are sharp and well defined except for the outside edge of the arm on the left side.  Have a look at the White on Light challenge a little while back.<br/> <br/>I thought using a flash and a lower exposure setting would help this photo, but then the shadows which define the statue''s shape would disappear and the sky would be gray and blend even more with the statue.  I don''t know how I would do this picture.  If the statue is white, maybe take a color picture with a blue sky to have the statue really stand out (of course, assuming this statue is outdoors).</td>', 'What event does this commemorate?  I''m not lowering your score; I''m just curious. With high-key photos like this one, you have to be careful to not let your subject''s boundaries get lost in the background.  Here, all of the statues edges are sharp and well defined except for the outside edge of the arm on the left side.  Have a look at the White on Light challenge a little while back. I thought using a flash and a lower exposure setting would help this photo, but then the shadows which define the statue''s shape would disappear and the sky would be gray and blend even more with the statue.  I don''t know how I would do this picture.  If the statue is white, maybe take a color picture with a blue sky to have the statue really stand out (of course, assuming this statue is outdoors).', '2005-08-10 21:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602463, 215885, 36050, '<td valign="top">Maybe cropping the right side to avoid the grate and the person leaning on it.</td>', 'Maybe cropping the right side to avoid the grate and the person leaning on it.', '2005-08-10 21:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602465, 215496, 31720, '<td valign="top">The tilt of this picture makes it difficult to look at without feeling dizzy.  Otherwise, I like the sepia treatment and the well-defined tones of the ship.</td>', 'The tilt of this picture makes it difficult to look at without feeling dizzy.  Otherwise, I like the sepia treatment and the well-defined tones of the ship.', '2005-08-10 22:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602470, 216205, 36050, '<td valign="top">Remembering some 80''s movies? Maybe anothe background could give more impact to the model.</td>', 'Remembering some 80''s movies? Maybe anothe background could give more impact to the model.', '2005-08-10 22:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602472, 215878, 31720, '<td valign="top">It looks like you reflected a flash off of the flip-up screen of the phone.  I''m trying to figure out why you have motion blur, unless it''s just out of focus.</td>', 'It looks like you reflected a flash off of the flip-up screen of the phone.  I''m trying to figure out why you have motion blur, unless it''s just out of focus.', '2005-08-10 22:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602507, 216052, 31720, '<td valign="top">[insert obligitory title comment]<br/> <br/>The only obvious problem I see is that the picture is tilted a little counterclockwise.  Otherwise, the colors are just dull, most likely because it''s such an overcast day.  I think increasing the contrast would do some good here.</td>', '[insert obligitory title comment] The only obvious problem I see is that the picture is tilted a little counterclockwise.  Otherwise, the colors are just dull, most likely because it''s such an overcast day.  I think increasing the contrast would do some good here.', '2005-08-10 22:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602508, 216008, 36462, '<td valign="top">Totally has the eighties ad. feel, with one exception...the t.v.  The image would have been more effective, in my opinion,  if the top third had been cropped out.</td>', 'Totally has the eighties ad. feel, with one exception...the t.v.  The image would have been more effective, in my opinion,  if the top third had been cropped out.', '2005-08-10 22:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602512, 213464, 33560, '<td valign="top">Wow.</td>', 'Wow.', '2005-08-10 22:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602516, 215707, 33560, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space and rabbiit ears.  This is easily the best use of rabbit ears I''ve seen in a very long time!</td>', 'Nice use of negative space and rabbiit ears.  This is easily the best use of rabbit ears I''ve seen in a very long time!', '2005-08-10 22:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602517, 214054, 41319, '<td valign="top">Interesting...</td>', 'Interesting...', '2005-08-10 22:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602520, 214467, 36050, '<td valign="top">The people and the cars look more modern than 1955 ;-)</td>', 'The people and the cars look more modern than 1955 ;-)', '2005-08-10 22:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602529, 213945, 33560, '<td valign="top">Quite lovely, and quite funny.  The left 10- 20% of the photo strikes me as being unuseful - I''d have been inclined to crop out the light colored fence or wall.</td>', 'Quite lovely, and quite funny.  The left 10- 20% of the photo strikes me as being unuseful - I''d have been inclined to crop out the light colored fence or wall.', '2005-08-10 22:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602530, 216019, 34659, '<td valign="top">I got to this photo while still voting and said to myself, "well, it''s over - here''s the blue ribbon winner hands down."  Magnificent shot - can''t believe you even got a rainbow in it - LOL!  Perfectly meets the challenge.  Thank you for following the challenge rules.  Perfect clarity, lighting, composition, color.  Outstanding.  10</td>', 'I got to this photo while still voting and said to myself, "well, it''s over - here''s the blue ribbon winner hands down."  Magnificent shot - can''t believe you even got a rainbow in it - LOL!  Perfectly meets the challenge.  Thank you for following the challenge rules.  Perfect clarity, lighting, composition, color.  Outstanding.  10', '2005-08-10 22:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602532, 215717, 31214, '<td valign="top">Wonder what challenge you meant this for???  I like the fact that you used the lighting from the blinds, but I see NO RELEVANCE to the challenge AT ALL!</td>', 'Wonder what challenge you meant this for???  I like the fact that you used the lighting from the blinds, but I see NO RELEVANCE to the challenge AT ALL!', '2005-08-10 22:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
