(1602616, 215637, 33560, '<td valign="top">The subject is quite photogenic and it produces a very strong sense of place. Nice colors.  There is an attempt to square everything with the frame which is only partially effective.  And even if it had been successful, I wonder if there had not been some more interesting or dynamic treatment of the building.</td>', 'The subject is quite photogenic and it produces a very strong sense of place. Nice colors.  There is an attempt to square everything with the frame which is only partially effective.  And even if it had been successful, I wonder if there had not been some more interesting or dynamic treatment of the building.', '2005-08-10 22:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
