(1602642, 214193, 6532, '<td valign="top">Too bright - I assume that this was taken in the bright of the mid day.  Angle is to wide - get in closer.  The shadow in the background is unnecessary - this will be eliminated when you move in closer.  WHat is the purpose of the stick on the side?  Nice idea.</td>', 'Too bright - I assume that this was taken in the bright of the mid day.  Angle is to wide - get in closer.  The shadow in the background is unnecessary - this will be eliminated when you move in closer.  WHat is the purpose of the stick on the side?  Nice idea.', '2005-08-10 22:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
