(1602673, 216004, 36679, '<td valign="top">Shame about the purple fringing in the roof shingles.. Interesting building, though.</td>', 'Shame about the purple fringing in the roof shingles.. Interesting building, though.', '2005-08-10 23:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602675, 215922, 40667, '<td valign="top">LOL, haha, nice job... what do they think, your going to bring the air craft down? don''t answer that, i know the answer, lol, great job~!</td>', 'LOL, haha, nice job... what do they think, your going to bring the air craft down? don''t answer that, i know the answer, lol, great job~!', '2005-08-10 23:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602684, 215181, 33560, '<td valign="top">Wow.  The composition is super and so are the other technical details (mostly.)  I even like the frame.  Very nice.<br/> <br/>Not sure what the editing rules were for the challenge, but I do wish those lines in the background were gone - the paucity of detail in the subject tempts the eye to wonder off to malinger on those insignificant details.</td>', 'Wow.  The composition is super and so are the other technical details (mostly.)  I even like the frame.  Very nice. Not sure what the editing rules were for the challenge, but I do wish those lines in the background were gone - the paucity of detail in the subject tempts the eye to wonder off to malinger on those insignificant details.', '2005-08-10 23:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602687, 215904, 33560, '<td valign="top">I notice that the grass is mowed in a direction parallel to the wooden bench.</td>', 'I notice that the grass is mowed in a direction parallel to the wooden bench.', '2005-08-10 23:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602692, 215791, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot!  Love the upside down thing.  Dead-on focus too.  Great job.  10</td>', 'Very cool shot!  Love the upside down thing.  Dead-on focus too.  Great job.  10', '2005-08-10 23:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
