(1602696, 215189, 33560, '<td valign="top">I love the textures of the wood and grass.  And I love the shape of the wheel.  There is a kind of emptiness to the photo which causes it to grow uninteresting fairly quickly.</td>', 'I love the textures of the wood and grass.  And I love the shape of the wheel.  There is a kind of emptiness to the photo which causes it to grow uninteresting fairly quickly.', '2005-08-10 23:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602698, 215655, 34659, '<td valign="top">Crop is a little tight on this - I''d like to see the top of the flame and the bottom edge of the gloves, but otherwise great job!  8</td>', 'Crop is a little tight on this - I''d like to see the top of the flame and the bottom edge of the gloves, but otherwise great job!  8', '2005-08-10 23:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602702, 216103, 34659, '<td valign="top">The only thing that bothers me about this shot is the blown out lower left corner.  Otherwise, I think it perfectly meets the challenge for the year 2005.  Very insightful, creative, and emotive.  Great job.  9</td>', 'The only thing that bothers me about this shot is the blown out lower left corner.  Otherwise, I think it perfectly meets the challenge for the year 2005.  Very insightful, creative, and emotive.  Great job.  9', '2005-08-10 23:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602703, 216029, 41990, '<td valign="top">I dig it.  Good angle.</td>', 'I dig it.  Good angle.', '2005-08-10 23:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602706, 216066, 33560, '<td valign="top">Nice color palette.  Nice, perspective.  The dull and rainy weather suits the photo perfectly.  I would, however,  really like to see some details under the car and in the wheel well.  Not sure how to do this without compromising the richness of the earthtones that make the photo otherwise good.</td>', 'Nice color palette.  Nice, perspective.  The dull and rainy weather suits the photo perfectly.  I would, however,  really like to see some details under the car and in the wheel well.  Not sure how to do this without compromising the richness of the earthtones that make the photo otherwise good.', '2005-08-10 23:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602708, 214735, 34659, '<td valign="top">The only drawback I have with this shot is that there''s so much going on here that it''s difficult to distinguish many things.  I love the effect and it''s very nostalgic.  I also think it meets the challenge perfectly.  I''d love to know how you did this.  8</td>', 'The only drawback I have with this shot is that there''s so much going on here that it''s difficult to distinguish many things.  I love the effect and it''s very nostalgic.  I also think it meets the challenge perfectly.  I''d love to know how you did this.  8', '2005-08-10 23:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602709, 215601, 41990, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to have seen the face of the trolley with more room to "move through" the photo.  Good color.</td>', 'Would have liked to have seen the face of the trolley with more room to "move through" the photo.  Good color.', '2005-08-10 23:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602711, 215618, 33560, '<td valign="top">The wood of the desk and clarinet are beautiful.  And the lighting, for the most part works well.  The whiteness of the music pages is too strong (we expect paper just twenty years old to be yellow - and even if that''s the wrong expectation, the whiteness still overpowers. IMO.) Despite an obvious effort to avoid it, there is a static feel to the composition.</td>', 'The wood of the desk and clarinet are beautiful.  And the lighting, for the most part works well.  The whiteness of the music pages is too strong (we expect paper just twenty years old to be yellow - and even if that''s the wrong expectation, the whiteness still overpowers. IMO.) Despite an obvious effort to avoid it, there is a static feel to the composition.', '2005-08-10 23:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602714, 215861, 40667, '<td valign="top">ooo- i love it~!</td>', 'ooo- i love it~!', '2005-08-10 23:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602716, 215717, 33560, '<td valign="top">Hmm.</td>', 'Hmm.', '2005-08-10 23:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
