(1602743, 215425, 41736, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, Really impressed with the clarity of the shot. I really that there is nothing in the background to break the sense or period.</td>', 'Wonderful shot, Really impressed with the clarity of the shot. I really that there is nothing in the background to break the sense or period.', '2005-08-10 23:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602746, 215518, 33560, '<td valign="top">Nice Hat. Composition is strong - especially the use of negative space.  I like the choice to go with color even thought the temptation would be sepia.  Curious about the reason for not using a blur layer to make the highlights glow a  little (or is this just and overused cliche?)</td>', 'Nice Hat. Composition is strong - especially the use of negative space.  I like the choice to go with color even thought the temptation would be sepia.  Curious about the reason for not using a blur layer to make the highlights glow a  little (or is this just and overused cliche?)', '2005-08-10 23:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602747, 215565, 41736, '<td valign="top">Just a tad to much glare for my eyes.</td>', 'Just a tad to much glare for my eyes.', '2005-08-10 23:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602748, 214008, 41990, '<td valign="top">Big Mustang fan!  Would have liked to have seen the lights on if possible.  I''m digging the shot.</td>', 'Big Mustang fan!  Would have liked to have seen the lights on if possible.  I''m digging the shot.', '2005-08-10 23:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602752, 214631, 33560, '<td valign="top">I am in awe of this photo.  Not only is the subject matter smack dab on, but the treatment of it emulates the style of the day perfectly: the graininess, the static treatment of the subject,  the arttificial distance caused by using a short focal lenghth cheep lens, and so on.  Truly inspired.</td>', 'I am in awe of this photo.  Not only is the subject matter smack dab on, but the treatment of it emulates the style of the day perfectly: the graininess, the static treatment of the subject,  the arttificial distance caused by using a short focal lenghth cheep lens, and so on.  Truly inspired.', '2005-08-10 23:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602755, 214467, 41990, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  I would have cropped the people out or exposed longer to blur their modern looks out and used a heavy ND filter or camera set to negative EV (to escape the white blowouts).  Good choice overall!!</td>', 'Great idea.  I would have cropped the people out or exposed longer to blur their modern looks out and used a heavy ND filter or camera set to negative EV (to escape the white blowouts).  Good choice overall!!', '2005-08-10 23:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602758, 216212, 41522, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry.  Forgive me for being thick, but I don''t get it.</td>', 'I''m sorry.  Forgive me for being thick, but I don''t get it.', '2005-08-10 23:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602761, 214822, 33560, '<td valign="top">The age of steam and transformers.  I find the subject to be very photogenic. And I like the way the lines lead the eye across the photo.  The palm trees add interest and so does the platform.  Those curious standards on the sidewalk I find distracting. And I wish, somehow, that I could see some of the details in the dark black shadowy areas - though I do understand why this was simply impossible.</td>', 'The age of steam and transformers.  I find the subject to be very photogenic. And I like the way the lines lead the eye across the photo.  The palm trees add interest and so does the platform.  Those curious standards on the sidewalk I find distracting. And I wish, somehow, that I could see some of the details in the dark black shadowy areas - though I do understand why this was simply impossible.', '2005-08-10 23:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602762, 215601, 41522, '<td valign="top">This has an interesting old time feel to this.</td>', 'This has an interesting old time feel to this.', '2005-08-10 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602764, 215286, 41522, '<td valign="top">This shot has a nice old time feel to it.  I like the perspective along the car, as if I just got out of the back seat to explore the store.</td>', 'This shot has a nice old time feel to it.  I like the perspective along the car, as if I just got out of the back seat to explore the store.', '2005-08-10 23:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602765, 213371, 31720, '<td valign="top">I like the processing that makes this photo look old.</td>', 'I like the processing that makes this photo look old.', '2005-08-10 23:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602768, 214984, 31720, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, although the subject is a rather small an unimportant part of it.</td>', 'Beautiful picture, although the subject is a rather small an unimportant part of it.', '2005-08-10 23:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602771, 214252, 33560, '<td valign="top">I think this is among the better miter saw photos I''ve ever seen.  I like the black background and the faming of the subject.  I like the details in the surface of the saw.  I do not, however, understand the connection with the challenge.</td>', 'I think this is among the better miter saw photos I''ve ever seen.  I like the black background and the faming of the subject.  I like the details in the surface of the saw.  I do not, however, understand the connection with the challenge.', '2005-08-10 23:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602772, 215970, 41522, '<td valign="top">Desparetly Seeking Susan?  I wish I could see her eyes.</td>', 'Desparetly Seeking Susan?  I wish I could see her eyes.', '2005-08-10 23:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602773, 216102, 41800, '<td valign="top">Nice job. I think you will score high.</td>', 'Nice job. I think you will score high.', '2005-08-10 23:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602775, 214726, 41175, '<td valign="top">great how you''ve got the sky above</td>', 'great how you''ve got the sky above', '2005-08-10 23:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602777, 214575, 31720, '<td valign="top">Good picture, although I''ve found that the subject of a photo should look towards the center most of the time.  All the space behind the man serves no purpose as my eye is kept away from it by where the man is looking.  Crop to the soldier''s back to get rid of wasted space.<br/> <br/>Still a good picture, though.</td>', 'Good picture, although I''ve found that the subject of a photo should look towards the center most of the time.  All the space behind the man serves no purpose as my eye is kept away from it by where the man is looking.  Crop to the soldier''s back to get rid of wasted space. Still a good picture, though.', '2005-08-10 23:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602778, 214984, 33560, '<td valign="top">Very funny.  The clouds are pretty.  I think the photo would be much much stronger if the silos blocked out much more of the sky and there were less black foreground.</td>', 'Very funny.  The clouds are pretty.  I think the photo would be much much stronger if the silos blocked out much more of the sky and there were less black foreground.', '2005-08-10 23:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602779, 216065, 41522, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I''m having a hard time understanding how this "depicts and era in time."    The whites in the photo are a little too bright for my liking.</td>', 'I''m sorry, I''m having a hard time understanding how this "depicts and era in time."    The whites in the photo are a little too bright for my liking.', '2005-08-10 23:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602785, 214804, 41522, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting pic. I feel it misses the mark on the assignment.</td>', 'It''s an interesting pic. I feel it misses the mark on the assignment.', '2005-08-10 23:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602788, 214916, 41522, '<td valign="top">The sky is a touch bright, but the photo is nicely applicable to the challenge and item does capture a different time.</td>', 'The sky is a touch bright, but the photo is nicely applicable to the challenge and item does capture a different time.', '2005-08-10 23:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602789, 216078, 41175, '<td valign="top">Its an ok shot</td>', 'Its an ok shot', '2005-08-10 23:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602795, 215785, 33560, '<td valign="top">Not sure I understand how a baseball cap, a bat, and ball evoke 1957; but I suppose if one were an avid baseball fan and recognized which team it was and who won what in that  year ... <br/> <br/>The lighting is crisp and beautiful. The composition is nice.  There is, however, as sterile cleanliness to bat and ball that suggest somewhat less interest in the life of the game than in the form of the tools by which it is played, and this subtly steals life from the composition.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'Not sure I understand how a baseball cap, a bat, and ball evoke 1957; but I suppose if one were an avid baseball fan and recognized which team it was and who won what in that  year ...  The lighting is crisp and beautiful. The composition is nice.  There is, however, as sterile cleanliness to bat and ball that suggest somewhat less interest in the life of the game than in the form of the tools by which it is played, and this subtly steals life from the composition.   ', '2005-08-10 23:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602799, 216103, 33560, '<td valign="top">Wow.</td>', 'Wow.', '2005-08-10 23:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602805, 213844, 41522, '<td valign="top">I think your trying to convey the modern teenager, with cell in hand is a defining part of 2005.  I can accept this.  The reason I say I think, is becuase I''m not 100% sure that the teenage girl is your main subject.  The focus and contrast on her seems weak to me and I''m only assuming that she has a cell phone to her ear.  Also, the bright spot on the top right is really distracting.</td>', 'I think your trying to convey the modern teenager, with cell in hand is a defining part of 2005.  I can accept this.  The reason I say I think, is becuase I''m not 100% sure that the teenage girl is your main subject.  The focus and contrast on her seems weak to me and I''m only assuming that she has a cell phone to her ear.  Also, the bright spot on the top right is really distracting.', '2005-08-10 23:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602807, 215172, 31720, '<td valign="top">Very good.  Forget all those who''ll say this doesn''t represent a specific time (although, why 1932?).</td>', 'Very good.  Forget all those who''ll say this doesn''t represent a specific time (although, why 1932?).', '2005-08-10 23:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602811, 215791, 33560, '<td valign="top">Turning it upside-down created quite a strong and unexpected effect.</td>', 'Turning it upside-down created quite a strong and unexpected effect.', '2005-08-11 00:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602812, 216102, 36462, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this image.  However, I am still not quite sure if I could do with or without the giant Winnie the Pooh.  On one hand it is pretty cute sitting there in the back....on the other, this type of Pooh merchandise wasn''t available until the late 60''s (I think, not until Disney picked up the Pooh label?).  Anywhoo, I didn''t nick pick on that detail when voting.......7  it''s just too cute and whimsical.</td>', 'I like the feel of this image.  However, I am still not quite sure if I could do with or without the giant Winnie the Pooh.  On one hand it is pretty cute sitting there in the back....on the other, this type of Pooh merchandise wasn''t available until the late 60''s (I think, not until Disney picked up the Pooh label?).  Anywhoo, I didn''t nick pick on that detail when voting.......7  it''s just too cute and whimsical.', '2005-08-11 00:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602815, 214824, 41522, '<td valign="top">I really like the car and find it fits with the challenge.  I really would have liked to have had you crop out the apartment buildings and the bright sky portion.  It would have concentrated our attention to the car and not conflicted the era with the modern looking high rises.</td>', 'I really like the car and find it fits with the challenge.  I really would have liked to have had you crop out the apartment buildings and the bright sky portion.  It would have concentrated our attention to the car and not conflicted the era with the modern looking high rises.', '2005-08-11 00:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602824, 215360, 41897, '<td valign="top">I just LOVE this! So adorable!</td>', 'I just LOVE this! So adorable!', '2005-08-11 00:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602827, 214206, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is truly great...totally looks like it was ripped from the 1977 brochure for the car...well..except for that  bit of dirt on the bottom...a super fine entry.</td>', 'This is truly great...totally looks like it was ripped from the 1977 brochure for the car...well..except for that  bit of dirt on the bottom...a super fine entry.', '2005-08-11 00:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602829, 214683, 36462, '<td valign="top">Image is non-descript without the title.  There maybe could be more in the image to imply the era.</td>', 'Image is non-descript without the title.  There maybe could be more in the image to imply the era.', '2005-08-11 00:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
