(1602870, 216026, 36462, '<td valign="top">I like the comp., but the lighting is a bit too harsh, and has washed out all the color.</td>', 'I like the comp., but the lighting is a bit too harsh, and has washed out all the color.', '2005-08-11 00:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602875, 215518, 41897, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!!!  Just awesome!!!!!!! This is gorgeous, well done!!!!  I would LOVE a print of this lovely picture!</td>', 'WOW!!!!!  Just awesome!!!!!!! This is gorgeous, well done!!!!  I would LOVE a print of this lovely picture!', '2005-08-11 00:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602876, 215565, 31720, '<td valign="top">Quibble: I don''t believe that there were folding chairs in 1836.<br/> <br/>I think the white, blown-out sky detracts from the old, sepai-tinted look you were going for.  It looks out of place in this photograph and attracts attention away from the house (at least my eye tends towards the bright sky more than the dull colors of the house).<br/> <br/>Good try.</td>', 'Quibble: I don''t believe that there were folding chairs in 1836. I think the white, blown-out sky detracts from the old, sepai-tinted look you were going for.  It looks out of place in this photograph and attracts attention away from the house (at least my eye tends towards the bright sky more than the dull colors of the house). Good try.', '2005-08-11 00:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602877, 214780, 40155, '<td valign="top">Wow!</td>', 'Wow!', '2005-08-11 00:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602878, 216207, 40155, '<td valign="top">Too much to capture at one time.</td>', 'Too much to capture at one time.', '2005-08-11 00:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
