(1602895, 216072, 36462, '<td valign="top">I like the subject, the comp. is a bit off tho.  I would have liked to have seen more of each object shown, crop maybe is too tight.  This could have been titled "War and Peace" (if the challenge description had not stated that the title was to be the ''year'').  The pistol seems to clash with the peace sign and guitar.  I am assuming that that is on purpose, to reflect the time, and the change in the social conscious...the war and the war protesters......  Or am I just reading too much into it?</td>', 'I like the subject, the comp. is a bit off tho.  I would have liked to have seen more of each object shown, crop maybe is too tight.  This could have been titled "War and Peace" (if the challenge description had not stated that the title was to be the ''year'').  The pistol seems to clash with the peace sign and guitar.  I am assuming that that is on purpose, to reflect the time, and the change in the social conscious...the war and the war protesters......  Or am I just reading too much into it?', '2005-08-11 00:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602898, 215492, 7570, '<td valign="top">your title made me laugh! yes, many may vote down when they see grain and noise in photos (in DPC anyway). a little comment on the model. she appears a little too rigid (is this a fake prayer?) and maybe the effect would have been better if her eyes are closed and head tilted down. just my personal opinion here, and sorry if she''s your daughter or something, coz I''m just trying to be honest about what i think. but i''m just a novice, so... hehe</td>', 'your title made me laugh! yes, many may vote down when they see grain and noise in photos (in DPC anyway). a little comment on the model. she appears a little too rigid (is this a fake prayer?) and maybe the effect would have been better if her eyes are closed and head tilted down. just my personal opinion here, and sorry if she''s your daughter or something, coz I''m just trying to be honest about what i think. but i''m just a novice, so... hehe', '2005-08-11 00:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602903, 215172, 7570, '<td valign="top">the desat dont really work too well for this composition. also, the rocks are not very interesting.</td>', 'the desat dont really work too well for this composition. also, the rocks are not very interesting.', '2005-08-11 00:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1602906, 216083, 41522, '<td valign="top">Sorry for being thick, but I don''t know what April 4 is?  The shot is nice and makes me think of the 60s.</td>', 'Sorry for being thick, but I don''t know what April 4 is?  The shot is nice and makes me think of the 60s.', '2005-08-11 00:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
