(1602930, 215811, 7570, '<td valign="top">i dont get this photo. those boys look like they are painting/plastering a wall. the background looks like a circus or carnival of sorts. cant really see the relation with 1783 or with time. in regard to photo interest, doesnt really hold up much and the faces on the boys could have been brighter with more light. thanks</td>', 'i dont get this photo. those boys look like they are painting/plastering a wall. the background looks like a circus or carnival of sorts. cant really see the relation with 1783 or with time. in regard to photo interest, doesnt really hold up much and the faces on the boys could have been brighter with more light. thanks', '2005-08-11 00:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
