(1603179, 215895, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I''m thinking that the little black across bottom and all the black at the top don''t seem to be serving any purpose. Doesn''t seem to add balance or good negative space at all. Maybe a tighter crop would make for a stronger presentation.</td>', 'Nice image. I''m thinking that the little black across bottom and all the black at the top don''t seem to be serving any purpose. Doesn''t seem to add balance or good negative space at all. Maybe a tighter crop would make for a stronger presentation.', '2005-08-11 03:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1603180, 214631, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice. A good leading line that takes the eye to the auto. Good comp. I like the grain. It works well for this image IMO. Looks like it''s straight from the 50''s. Good job.</td>', 'Nice. A good leading line that takes the eye to the auto. Good comp. I like the grain. It works well for this image IMO. Looks like it''s straight from the 50''s. Good job.', '2005-08-11 03:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1603189, 215923, 19831, '<td valign="top">But it is not 10 after 6 right now. Of course it will be twice today, but that is not now, that is then.</td>', 'But it is not 10 after 6 right now. Of course it will be twice today, but that is not now, that is then.', '2005-08-11 04:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1603195, 216030, 19831, '<td valign="top">I had to really look hard for a minute to see the thumb, and that this was a hand with one of those lace fingerless gloves on. I remember those well :-) I think that if more of the hand were showing, so it was more readily obvious, you might be really on to something.</td>', 'I had to really look hard for a minute to see the thumb, and that this was a hand with one of those lace fingerless gloves on. I remember those well :-) I think that if more of the hand were showing, so it was more readily obvious, you might be really on to something.', '2005-08-11 04:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1603203, 213844, 19831, '<td valign="top">I see what you''re trying to depict here with the kid''s clothing styles and the cell phone. A good idea I think. I feel in this case the movement blur is not working. The setting seems like it could be interesting, but again in this case, this particular composition, it just seems busy and cluttered to me. A simpler background, with the subject static and focused, and show that phone more prominently, you might really be on to something.</td>', 'I see what you''re trying to depict here with the kid''s clothing styles and the cell phone. A good idea I think. I feel in this case the movement blur is not working. The setting seems like it could be interesting, but again in this case, this particular composition, it just seems busy and cluttered to me. A simpler background, with the subject static and focused, and show that phone more prominently, you might really be on to something.', '2005-08-11 04:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1603205, 215164, 19831, '<td valign="top">A good idea perhaps, but a very static unstimulating composition. The setting feels very cluttered, and the background rather bland, except for the bright red door, which seems like kind of a major distraction. Something in focus would be a big help also.</td>', 'A good idea perhaps, but a very static unstimulating composition. The setting feels very cluttered, and the background rather bland, except for the bright red door, which seems like kind of a major distraction. Something in focus would be a big help also.', '2005-08-11 04:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1603210, 215835, 19831, '<td valign="top">A good idea perhaps. I find my eye wandering the image looking for an anchor point, but not finding any strong subject or focal point. And, maybe it is what you were going for, but I find the bright sun hot spot and the blown out grass unappealing.</td>', 'A good idea perhaps. I find my eye wandering the image looking for an anchor point, but not finding any strong subject or focal point. And, maybe it is what you were going for, but I find the bright sun hot spot and the blown out grass unappealing.', '2005-08-11 04:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1603219, 216041, 38119, '<td valign="top">lol Woot GR. :)</td>', 'lol Woot GR. :)', '2005-08-11 04:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
