(1603234, 215399, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, simple yet strongly conveys the idea. Nice attention to detail with your model, complete to the greased hair. The bike is a real nice touch. Good job.</td>', 'Very nice composition, simple yet strongly conveys the idea. Nice attention to detail with your model, complete to the greased hair. The bike is a real nice touch. Good job.', '2005-08-11 04:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
