(1603507, 214631, 41522, '<td valign="top">This feels like a picture of a picture.  If I''m wrong on that, please accept my apologies.</td>', 'This feels like a picture of a picture.  If I''m wrong on that, please accept my apologies.', '2005-08-11 10:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1603509, 216098, 41522, '<td valign="top">An interesting photo with the attempted grain.  The sky is very bright and as such, I find it distracting.</td>', 'An interesting photo with the attempted grain.  The sky is very bright and as such, I find it distracting.', '2005-08-11 10:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1603510, 215020, 41522, '<td valign="top">While this is an interesting shot, and I like the way it breaks the rule of thirds, I personally don''t see the Time Capsule challenge being met.  This could easiy have been titled 1957 or any other year.</td>', 'While this is an interesting shot, and I like the way it breaks the rule of thirds, I personally don''t see the Time Capsule challenge being met.  This could easiy have been titled 1957 or any other year.', '2005-08-11 10:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1603515, 214741, 41522, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this photo.  The colour tones make it feel like an old time shot.    Composition is okay and the graduated light is cool.  Fits in the challenge.  Good job.</td>', 'I like the feel of this photo.  The colour tones make it feel like an old time shot.    Composition is okay and the graduated light is cool.  Fits in the challenge.  Good job.', '2005-08-11 10:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1603516, 214963, 41522, '<td valign="top">What a great old car.  Nice tones.  Fits well into the challenge.</td>', 'What a great old car.  Nice tones.  Fits well into the challenge.', '2005-08-11 10:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1603521, 214180, 41522, '<td valign="top">A nice personal time capsule image.  A nice arrangement that fits well into the challenge.  Good stuff.</td>', 'A nice personal time capsule image.  A nice arrangement that fits well into the challenge.  Good stuff.', '2005-08-11 10:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1603529, 214796, 41522, '<td valign="top">I like the arrangment and the photo on the desk is a perfect fit.  The level of the photo is throuwing me off ... with the lean of the bookcase in the background, it make me feel like everything is sliding to the right.</td>', 'I like the arrangment and the photo on the desk is a perfect fit.  The level of the photo is throuwing me off ... with the lean of the bookcase in the background, it make me feel like everything is sliding to the right.', '2005-08-11 10:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1603531, 214521, 38592, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo, but I am a bit concerned.  You either:<br/>a) Have way too much time and money on your hands to compose such a great picture<br/>b) Spent way too much time tracking down the perfect picture for this submission<br/>c) Cheated!<br/> <br/>Either way... great pic!  Should finish in the top 3.</td>', 'This is a great photo, but I am a bit concerned.  You either:a) Have way too much time and money on your hands to compose such a great pictureb) Spent way too much time tracking down the perfect picture for this submissionc) Cheated! Either way... great pic!  Should finish in the top 3.', '2005-08-11 10:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1603532, 214366, 16488, '<td valign="top">Well, I didn''t believe your title, so before I commented I made a little internet search--always something new to learn, isn''t there?<br/> <br/>That out of the way, I like this image.  The hint of high cumulous clouds at the bottom increases the drama and the sense of flight.  The grain works well with the black and white image--nice choice for the challenge topic. Lovely range of tones.  It does appear you have sensor dust or a smudge on the lens recorded just below and left of the basket--too bad we can''t fix these things in basic challenges--not a huge distraction anyway.</td>', 'Well, I didn''t believe your title, so before I commented I made a little internet search--always something new to learn, isn''t there? That out of the way, I like this image.  The hint of high cumulous clouds at the bottom increases the drama and the sense of flight.  The grain works well with the black and white image--nice choice for the challenge topic. Lovely range of tones.  It does appear you have sensor dust or a smudge on the lens recorded just below and left of the basket--too bad we can''t fix these things in basic challenges--not a huge distraction anyway.', '2005-08-11 10:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1603535, 215707, 38592, '<td valign="top">I love this pic and think it is very creative.  I''m giving it a solid 9, with only 1 point taken off because of the slight light reflection in the middle of the screen.  Good job.</td>', 'I love this pic and think it is very creative.  I''m giving it a solid 9, with only 1 point taken off because of the slight light reflection in the middle of the screen.  Good job.', '2005-08-11 10:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1603536, 215391, 41522, '<td valign="top">Nice tones of blue.  Instantly recognizable as a lava lamp.  While the shot does fit nicely with the challenge, it needs some more impact</td>', 'Nice tones of blue.  Instantly recognizable as a lava lamp.  While the shot does fit nicely with the challenge, it needs some more impact', '2005-08-11 10:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1603537, 214995, 38592, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  The dust/smoke really help this picture look more authentic and the red flag give the picture a burst of color and really makes it pop.  I would assume top 3.</td>', 'Great picture.  The dust/smoke really help this picture look more authentic and the red flag give the picture a burst of color and really makes it pop.  I would assume top 3.', '2005-08-11 10:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
