(1603572, 215956, 38592, '<td valign="top">Not sure what those blue things are, but they look really cool.  This gets high marks from me although I have to give it a slight deduction for it being a stretch to meet the challenge.  "7"</td>', 'Not sure what those blue things are, but they look really cool.  This gets high marks from me although I have to give it a slight deduction for it being a stretch to meet the challenge.  "7"', '2005-08-11 11:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
