(1604023, 216011, 38592, '<td valign="top">I like this picture with the selective desat, however for some reason the signs about the counter seem way too sharp and are slightly distracting.</td>', 'I like this picture with the selective desat, however for some reason the signs about the counter seem way too sharp and are slightly distracting.', '2005-08-11 14:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1604024, 215963, 41198, '<td valign="top">I like the "feeling" of this shot.</td>', 'I like the "feeling" of this shot.', '2005-08-11 14:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1604025, 215957, 3669, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pose.  I really like the light sepia tone and the overexposed edges.  I like how the highlights came out in her hair.</td>', 'Beautiful pose.  I really like the light sepia tone and the overexposed edges.  I like how the highlights came out in her hair.', '2005-08-11 14:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1604031, 216190, 3669, '<td valign="top">Old film projector?  I kind of like the abstract look of this picture and the lighting.  Good use of B&amp;W  7</td>', 'Old film projector?  I kind of like the abstract look of this picture and the lighting.  Good use of B&W  7', '2005-08-11 14:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1604034, 214467, 3669, '<td valign="top">MMMM, makes me hungry for an ice cream cone.  I like places like this.  Picture is well done with good lighting.</td>', 'MMMM, makes me hungry for an ice cream cone.  I like places like this.  Picture is well done with good lighting.', '2005-08-11 14:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1604042, 215920, 3669, '<td valign="top">I''ve been looking at this picture to figure out what your eye was seeing.  I''m not quite getting it, mostly I think because I''m not sure what I''m looking at.  Perhaps there is a story about this place that is not conveyed in the picture.  Definately worn down with interesting texture.</td>', 'I''ve been looking at this picture to figure out what your eye was seeing.  I''m not quite getting it, mostly I think because I''m not sure what I''m looking at.  Perhaps there is a story about this place that is not conveyed in the picture.  Definately worn down with interesting texture.', '2005-08-11 14:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1604046, 215968, 3669, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective on an everyday subject.  The lighting is nice.</td>', 'Interesting perspective on an everyday subject.  The lighting is nice.', '2005-08-11 14:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1604047, 215707, 41198, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and use of the shadows.  With the center of the screen wasn''t quite so blown out.  I especially like the use of the Rabbit ears! :)</td>', 'I like the composition and use of the shadows.  With the center of the screen wasn''t quite so blown out.  I especially like the use of the Rabbit ears! :)', '2005-08-11 14:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1604048, 215820, 3669, '<td valign="top">This picture is very flat looking and a little OOF.  Would like to see more detail and depth.  Perhaps more of a corner shot would have been good.</td>', 'This picture is very flat looking and a little OOF.  Would like to see more detail and depth.  Perhaps more of a corner shot would have been good.', '2005-08-11 14:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1604049, 213963, 41198, '<td valign="top">This is a little dark for my liking.  Wish there was a bit more light and detail on the upper brim of the hat</td>', 'This is a little dark for my liking.  Wish there was a bit more light and detail on the upper brim of the hat', '2005-08-11 14:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1604053, 215181, 41198, '<td valign="top">I like the comp of this one.  Although personally it seems a little "muted" for my tastes.  Perhaps in color this might have had more impact.</td>', 'I like the comp of this one.  Although personally it seems a little "muted" for my tastes.  Perhaps in color this might have had more impact.', '2005-08-11 14:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1604055, 214772, 3669, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen these things on TV but haven''t seen them around where I live yet.  I don''t really like the sepia tone and overexposed look of this photo.  Doesn''t seem appropriate for the subject and the time period.  The background is very busy and the fire hydrant behind the scooter is distracting.  I would like to see more detail.</td>', 'I''ve seen these things on TV but haven''t seen them around where I live yet.  I don''t really like the sepia tone and overexposed look of this photo.  Doesn''t seem appropriate for the subject and the time period.  The background is very busy and the fire hydrant behind the scooter is distracting.  I would like to see more detail.', '2005-08-11 14:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1604056, 214521, 34194, '<td valign="top">Great capture and couldn''t be a better fit for the challenge. I can''t help but think that this may have been better with a little further post editing to give it that true old time look and feel. For sure, you have too much time on your hands!  I give it a 9. First page material no doubt.</td>', 'Great capture and couldn''t be a better fit for the challenge. I can''t help but think that this may have been better with a little further post editing to give it that true old time look and feel. For sure, you have too much time on your hands!  I give it a 9. First page material no doubt.', '2005-08-11 14:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1604059, 216025, 41198, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but I would like to see more contrast between the building and the hillside.  Not sure how you could have done that though.</td>', 'Nice shot but I would like to see more contrast between the building and the hillside.  Not sure how you could have done that though.', '2005-08-11 14:31:43.000000', NULL, 1);
