(1604159, 214611, 41522, '<td valign="top">A good fit with the challenge.  A way of life now long gone except in the heritage villages.  The colour tones add to the old time feel.  I think that the background shelving is a bit distracting despite the dark lighting.  Maybe an off-centred composition of the shoe maker would have created a more dynamic photo.  JMO.</td>', 'A good fit with the challenge.  A way of life now long gone except in the heritage villages.  The colour tones add to the old time feel.  I think that the background shelving is a bit distracting despite the dark lighting.  Maybe an off-centred composition of the shoe maker would have created a more dynamic photo.  JMO.', '2005-08-11 15:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1604162, 215895, 40667, '<td valign="top">WOnderfull photo, i wouldn''t be suprised if a ribbon came your way~! you should be verry pleased with the result~! good job~!</td>', 'WOnderfull photo, i wouldn''t be suprised if a ribbon came your way~! you should be verry pleased with the result~! good job~!', '2005-08-11 15:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
