(1604164, 214995, 41522, '<td valign="top">The smoke, composition and colour of the flag make for an interesting photo.  I like how the flag advances in the frame and the soldiers disappear in the smoke.  The patriotism is good.  The photo fits nicely in the challenge.</td>', 'The smoke, composition and colour of the flag make for an interesting photo.  I like how the flag advances in the frame and the soldiers disappear in the smoke.  The patriotism is good.  The photo fits nicely in the challenge.', '2005-08-11 15:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1604167, 215399, 41522, '<td valign="top">Everything fits really nice into the challenge except the modern looking garage door.  I like the set up of the photo.  I would have liked there to have been a more even space around the coke machine and the boys shoulder, but that is a minor detail.</td>', 'Everything fits really nice into the challenge except the modern looking garage door.  I like the set up of the photo.  I would have liked there to have been a more even space around the coke machine and the boys shoulder, but that is a minor detail.', '2005-08-11 15:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
