(1604493, 214963, 33947, '<td valign="top">I''m really taken with the sepia-like tonality of this one. Very nice. Perfect for this challenge. Like how it''s positioned in the frame, too, and the lighting is nice.. 10</td>', 'I''m really taken with the sepia-like tonality of this one. Very nice. Perfect for this challenge. Like how it''s positioned in the frame, too, and the lighting is nice.. 10', '2005-08-11 17:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
