(1604508, 216035, 33947, '<td valign="top">Really nice composition and line. Coloration is good, too. Photo sets a warm mood. Really like it. 10</td>', 'Really nice composition and line. Coloration is good, too. Photo sets a warm mood. Really like it. 10', '2005-08-11 18:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
