(1604531, 215892, 41554, '<td valign="top">A bit too much cropping, perhaps?</td>', 'A bit too much cropping, perhaps?', '2005-08-11 18:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1604555, 216011, 16488, '<td valign="top">Apparently, I need to go win a ribbon before you can value my comments, therefore I will strike this one. (I''d take my vote back, too, if I could.)<br/> <br/><strike>Rather cool!  I like the choice of desaturation--the reds just pop.<br/>Given the many anachronisms in this image, I would have believed 1975 long before ''55--especially with the long hair on the model.  (Others include the plastic pitcher, the catsup bottles, the towel dispenser...)<br/>Still a fine image in which the highlights sing.</strike><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-12 14:15:01.</i></td>', 'Apparently, I need to go win a ribbon before you can value my comments, therefore I will strike this one. (I''d take my vote back, too, if I could.) Rather cool!  I like the choice of desaturation--the reds just pop.Given the many anachronisms in this image, I would have believed 1975 long before ''55--especially with the long hair on the model.  (Others include the plastic pitcher, the catsup bottles, the towel dispenser...)Still a fine image in which the highlights sing.', '2005-08-11 18:45:24.000000', '2005-10-12 15:15:01.000000', 1),
(1604584, 214741, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I like the square crop.</td>', 'Great shot, I like the square crop.', '2005-08-11 19:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1604590, 215189, 4177, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot, but I think a little lower shooting angle would have been better. I get the impression here that the photographer was too lazy to bend down a bit. (Not saying that you _are_ lazy, mind you -- it''s probably more of something like I''d do, which is perhaps where the impression comes from.) 7</td>', 'This is a very nice shot, but I think a little lower shooting angle would have been better. I get the impression here that the photographer was too lazy to bend down a bit. (Not saying that you _are_ lazy, mind you -- it''s probably more of something like I''d do, which is perhaps where the impression comes from.) 7', '2005-08-11 19:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1604592, 214521, 3032, '<td valign="top">A bit bright, but good content and decent composition. <br/>Standing back and using a long telelens would compress the scene more, it would give less of a distant look.</td>', 'A bit bright, but good content and decent composition. Standing back and using a long telelens would compress the scene more, it would give less of a distant look.', '2005-08-11 19:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1604594, 214995, 4177, '<td valign="top">Holy cow! Mighty impressive!</td>', 'Holy cow! Mighty impressive!', '2005-08-11 19:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1604607, 214824, 25754, '<td valign="top">Lovely old car.. I like that the owner is sitting inside. I think this would have worked way better as a black+white or duotone, with the buildings in the background cropped out.</td>', 'Lovely old car.. I like that the owner is sitting inside. I think this would have worked way better as a black+white or duotone, with the buildings in the background cropped out.', '2005-08-11 19:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1604625, 215792, 25754, '<td valign="top">I''ll have to show this to my friend who''s a huge bowie fan! I can see that you are as well :)<br/>Your shot is a bit busy but the arrangement is nice. I''m just not sure about the blue border.. I would have preferred none or black instead.<br/>Good concept for a time capsule!</td>', 'I''ll have to show this to my friend who''s a huge bowie fan! I can see that you are as well :)Your shot is a bit busy but the arrangement is nice. I''m just not sure about the blue border.. I would have preferred none or black instead.Good concept for a time capsule!', '2005-08-11 19:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1604629, 215706, 25754, '<td valign="top">This is quite pretty. I love the composition and toning.</td>', 'This is quite pretty. I love the composition and toning.', '2005-08-11 19:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1604640, 215618, 4177, '<td valign="top">The mouthpiece is rotated 180 degress or so from where it should be. The reed goes on the bottom. Also, that music doesn''t look like clarinet music to me. Piano exercise pieces, perhaps? Other than that, not a bad image. 6</td>', 'The mouthpiece is rotated 180 degress or so from where it should be. The reed goes on the bottom. Also, that music doesn''t look like clarinet music to me. Piano exercise pieces, perhaps? Other than that, not a bad image. 6', '2005-08-11 19:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
