(1604664, 213464, 8377, '<td valign="top">very awesome, i love the light from the sky. this is just a stunning image. this had better be in the top 10!!!</td>', 'very awesome, i love the light from the sky. this is just a stunning image. this had better be in the top 10!!!', '2005-08-11 19:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
