(1604766, 214963, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great sepia (duotone?) shot. Simple and effective. I like the angle and the lighting. Nicely done.</td>', 'Great sepia (duotone?) shot. Simple and effective. I like the angle and the lighting. Nicely done.', '2005-08-11 20:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
