(1605816, 215894, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good effort to meet the Challenge.  Criticism; I would like to see more detail (closer angle) on the smaller items, coins, bullets and watch.  I also wonder if this photograph might have looked better in b/w, though I know those said smaller items would get ''lost'' then, but if they were at the ''fore'' perhaps that might have helped.  Maybe just a different angle and placement of items (ie maybe the newspaper laying diagonally), would have made this a better photograph in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Good effort to meet the Challenge.  Criticism; I would like to see more detail (closer angle) on the smaller items, coins, bullets and watch.  I also wonder if this photograph might have looked better in b/w, though I know those said smaller items would get ''lost'' then, but if they were at the ''fore'' perhaps that might have helped.  Maybe just a different angle and placement of items (ie maybe the newspaper laying diagonally), would have made this a better photograph in my opinion.', '2005-08-12 09:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605817, 215625, 40355, '<td valign="top">Deep shadows take away from this shot, although I imagine that this may have come from a "no flash allowed" display.  8</td>', 'Deep shadows take away from this shot, although I imagine that this may have come from a "no flash allowed" display.  8', '2005-08-12 09:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605819, 216065, 40355, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot, but there''s nothing in it that would tell a random person, "Hey, this is 2005!"</td>', 'Not a bad shot, but there''s nothing in it that would tell a random person, "Hey, this is 2005!"', '2005-08-12 09:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605822, 214271, 24389, '<td valign="top">nice photo :)</td>', 'nice photo :)', '2005-08-12 09:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605826, 215471, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Met the Challenge (I think a photo of this put into a ''time capsule'' would give future generations a good depiction of this era/year).  Criticism; Whilst I think you have a good ''setting'', there are a few factors which ''detract'' from the theme.  The air vent, the ''flip flops'' and possibly the carpet.  If you had removed those or ''hid'' them, it would have made this a better (read more authentic) photograph in my opinion.  I like the added character of the cat, just would like to see it sitting still.</td>', '7 - Met the Challenge (I think a photo of this put into a ''time capsule'' would give future generations a good depiction of this era/year).  Criticism; Whilst I think you have a good ''setting'', there are a few factors which ''detract'' from the theme.  The air vent, the ''flip flops'' and possibly the carpet.  If you had removed those or ''hid'' them, it would have made this a better (read more authentic) photograph in my opinion.  I like the added character of the cat, just would like to see it sitting still.', '2005-08-12 09:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605828, 216011, 40922, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done! The effects of B&amp;W and red work well on this photo. Very 50''s.<br/> <br/> I wonder if the pic would improve if the person was at a different angle to the camera (vs completely turned away) - not sure. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Very nicely done! The effects of B&W and red work well on this photo. Very 50''s.  I wonder if the pic would improve if the person was at a different angle to the camera (vs completely turned away) - not sure.  ', '2005-08-12 09:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605829, 215518, 37961, '<td valign="top">Good color tones &amp; action. 10</td>', 'Good color tones & action. 10', '2005-08-12 09:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605831, 214206, 37961, '<td valign="top">Fairly Convincing. 10</td>', 'Fairly Convincing. 10', '2005-08-12 09:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605834, 216011, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Met the Challenge (I think a photo of this put into a ''time capsule'' would give future generations a good depiction of this era/year).  I like the effects you have used here I think they are ideal for bringing out the textures and color here.  Criticism; not too much, perhaps the red carnation? clashes a little, for ''pure authenticity'' the waitress'' hipsters detract a little in my opinion.  Perhaps a slightly different angle or crop could have made this a better photograph, not sure, I think you have done well.</td>', '7 - Met the Challenge (I think a photo of this put into a ''time capsule'' would give future generations a good depiction of this era/year).  I like the effects you have used here I think they are ideal for bringing out the textures and color here.  Criticism; not too much, perhaps the red carnation? clashes a little, for ''pure authenticity'' the waitress'' hipsters detract a little in my opinion.  Perhaps a slightly different angle or crop could have made this a better photograph, not sure, I think you have done well.', '2005-08-12 09:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605837, 215707, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Met the Challenge (bit of a stretch in my opinion, but it is a ''mood'' based one for me so a ''pass'' in my books).  Criticism;  Whilst I like the ''bareness'' and the focus on the ''twilight zone on tv'', the grain of the ''floor'' overpowers the setting in my opinion.  For me, if you had a little rug or something it may have made this a better photograph, but seeing as that is a ''toy tv'' (?) hard to find a rug that small.  I like the shadow effect and I just think you have captured a little of the ''feel'' of that time/era, even in the ''little set''.</td>', '7 - Met the Challenge (bit of a stretch in my opinion, but it is a ''mood'' based one for me so a ''pass'' in my books).  Criticism;  Whilst I like the ''bareness'' and the focus on the ''twilight zone on tv'', the grain of the ''floor'' overpowers the setting in my opinion.  For me, if you had a little rug or something it may have made this a better photograph, but seeing as that is a ''toy tv'' (?) hard to find a rug that small.  I like the shadow effect and I just think you have captured a little of the ''feel'' of that time/era, even in the ''little set''.', '2005-08-12 09:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605841, 216110, 41522, '<td valign="top">The time when hand washing was the norm.  I think you''ve done a good job.  This could have been more impactful without the modern looking bra.  Fits nicely into the challenge</td>', 'The time when hand washing was the norm.  I think you''ve done a good job.  This could have been more impactful without the modern looking bra.  Fits nicely into the challenge', '2005-08-12 10:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605844, 215189, 40355, '<td valign="top">Good shot, great textures and shadow/light interplay.  10</td>', 'Good shot, great textures and shadow/light interplay.  10', '2005-08-12 10:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605846, 215707, 41522, '<td valign="top">I really like the look of this ... sort of a Twilight Zone of the Twilight Zone.  The broght spot on the centre of the Twilight Zone text is a bit of a distraction.  Good fit into the chalenge.</td>', 'I really like the look of this ... sort of a Twilight Zone of the Twilight Zone.  The broght spot on the centre of the Twilight Zone text is a bit of a distraction.  Good fit into the chalenge.', '2005-08-12 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605849, 214987, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Met the Challenge (I think a photo of this put into a ''time capsule'' would give future generations a good depiction of this era/year, especially in an economic sense).  It is a little ''stretch'' in my opinion on the Challenge, but as I say you captured a certain essence of this particular era and well.  Very nice photo too.   Criticism; not much, perhaps more distinction on the lamp post if possible.  I really like the angle and the b/w? works well here, keeping it a nice clean shot.   Maybe even sharper of an angle to get in more of the post and fore building, and enable you to crop out that ''level'' that has the line across it on the fore building.  Possibly without the frame to give more ''height'' - not sure.</td>', '7 - Met the Challenge (I think a photo of this put into a ''time capsule'' would give future generations a good depiction of this era/year, especially in an economic sense).  It is a little ''stretch'' in my opinion on the Challenge, but as I say you captured a certain essence of this particular era and well.  Very nice photo too.   Criticism; not much, perhaps more distinction on the lamp post if possible.  I really like the angle and the b/w? works well here, keeping it a nice clean shot.   Maybe even sharper of an angle to get in more of the post and fore building, and enable you to crop out that ''level'' that has the line across it on the fore building.  Possibly without the frame to give more ''height'' - not sure.', '2005-08-12 10:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605850, 214147, 40355, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, wonderful color contrast and composition, but the "sense of time" is a little vague.  Still, I''ll ive you the benefit of the doubt - this is truely wonderful. 10</td>', 'This is a great shot, wonderful color contrast and composition, but the "sense of time" is a little vague.  Still, I''ll ive you the benefit of the doubt - this is truely wonderful. 10', '2005-08-12 10:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605856, 215425, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Met the Challenge (I think a photo of this put into a ''time capsule'' would give future generations a good depiction of this era/year, if that is the correct ''interpretation'' of the Challenge).  This is a great shot.  Criticism; not much at all.  I really like the steam you have captured, the characters, the texture/surface of the train - ok, maybe those power lines I just noticed should not be there in 1922 for ''true authenticity'' - who knows.  The lamp posts look good, the b/w or sepia? looks very good - perhaps just a slightly more front on angle to get more perspective on the train and platform, and get both those (but especially the ''left) shot of steam in the frame.</td>', '8 - Met the Challenge (I think a photo of this put into a ''time capsule'' would give future generations a good depiction of this era/year, if that is the correct ''interpretation'' of the Challenge).  This is a great shot.  Criticism; not much at all.  I really like the steam you have captured, the characters, the texture/surface of the train - ok, maybe those power lines I just noticed should not be there in 1922 for ''true authenticity'' - who knows.  The lamp posts look good, the b/w or sepia? looks very good - perhaps just a slightly more front on angle to get more perspective on the train and platform, and get both those (but especially the ''left) shot of steam in the frame.', '2005-08-12 10:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605861, 214054, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Met the Challenge (I think a photo of this put into a ''time capsule'' would give future generations a good depiction of this era/year - though it requires a tiny ''stretch'' for me in the imagination for this Challenge).  This is very well done.  And you kept just the year in without any ''explanation'' - good for you, it doesn''t need it (though personally I''d like to see 30,000 BC or whatever is more ''authentic'', perhaps what you have is right, who knows).   Criticism; not much, I like the color treatment/effect, you''ve done very well with the ''props'', the coloring/darkness washes out the costume so that it is not discernible enough to see the authenticity.  The ''action'' is perfect, and amusing.  Perhaps without the frame - not sure, just to give a ''largeness''.  The ''feel'' you have created with the set up and the pp is very good in my opinion.  You get the most points from me for creativity.</td>', '8 - Met the Challenge (I think a photo of this put into a ''time capsule'' would give future generations a good depiction of this era/year - though it requires a tiny ''stretch'' for me in the imagination for this Challenge).  This is very well done.  And you kept just the year in without any ''explanation'' - good for you, it doesn''t need it (though personally I''d like to see 30,000 BC or whatever is more ''authentic'', perhaps what you have is right, who knows).   Criticism; not much, I like the color treatment/effect, you''ve done very well with the ''props'', the coloring/darkness washes out the costume so that it is not discernible enough to see the authenticity.  The ''action'' is perfect, and amusing.  Perhaps without the frame - not sure, just to give a ''largeness''.  The ''feel'' you have created with the set up and the pp is very good in my opinion.  You get the most points from me for creativity.', '2005-08-12 10:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1605865, 214217, 24613, '<td valign="top">This looks a bit grainy - although that may be intentional.  I really like the "step back in time" feel.  You are "dead on" meeting the challenge.  Very good work. 9</td>', 'This looks a bit grainy - although that may be intentional.  I really like the "step back in time" feel.  You are "dead on" meeting the challenge.  Very good work. 9', '2005-08-12 10:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
