(1606387, 215716, 41370, '<td valign="top">An uninteresting photo but I did feel the year.</td>', 'An uninteresting photo but I did feel the year.', '2005-08-12 15:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1606389, 215651, 41522, '<td valign="top">Based on you title, the weeds are the main subject in this photo.  For me, I would like to see the weeds take a prominent place in the photo.  I find that the pole is what me eye goes to the most.</td>', 'Based on you title, the weeds are the main subject in this photo.  For me, I would like to see the weeds take a prominent place in the photo.  I find that the pole is what me eye goes to the most.', '2005-08-12 15:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1606393, 215662, 41370, '<td valign="top">I get what you were going for but the photo isn''t very interesting.</td>', 'I get what you were going for but the photo isn''t very interesting.', '2005-08-12 15:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1606394, 215983, 41522, '<td valign="top">An interesting scene.  The cropping is a bit of a question in my mind.  The partial building on the right and the tight crop on the left house give me an uncomfortable feeling about the crop.  Eliminating the building on the right and giving just a bit more room on the left side of the left house would have bee nicer.  The modern day SUV coming down the hill kind of ruins the 1960 feel of the photo for me.  JMO.</td>', 'An interesting scene.  The cropping is a bit of a question in my mind.  The partial building on the right and the tight crop on the left house give me an uncomfortable feeling about the crop.  Eliminating the building on the right and giving just a bit more room on the left side of the left house would have bee nicer.  The modern day SUV coming down the hill kind of ruins the 1960 feel of the photo for me.  JMO.', '2005-08-12 15:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1606398, 215699, 41522, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photo indeed and as such, I give it some points for that.  The photo does not "depict an era in time" as the challenge suggests and the title isn''t helping to point me to an era either.  This would be a very nice photo for a sunset challenge or a harvet / working in the fields challenge.</td>', 'This is a very nice photo indeed and as such, I give it some points for that.  The photo does not "depict an era in time" as the challenge suggests and the title isn''t helping to point me to an era either.  This would be a very nice photo for a sunset challenge or a harvet / working in the fields challenge.', '2005-08-12 15:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1606399, 215835, 41370, '<td valign="top">I didn''t like the lens flare.  I''m sure it''s what you intended to do to give it the feel of "0".</td>', 'I didn''t like the lens flare.  I''m sure it''s what you intended to do to give it the feel of "0".', '2005-08-12 15:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1606400, 216048, 41522, '<td valign="top">The colouring in the photo seems a bit off to me.  Maxwell''s Silver Hammer appears gold on my monitor at work and at home.  The still life is rather sparse to keep my interest peaked.  JMO.</td>', 'The colouring in the photo seems a bit off to me.  Maxwell''s Silver Hammer appears gold on my monitor at work and at home.  The still life is rather sparse to keep my interest peaked.  JMO.', '2005-08-12 15:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1606401, 214384, 41370, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice picture but I voted most landscape pictures stating 2005 low because it was easy.  the cloud looks like a dragon spewing smoke.</td>', 'It''s a nice picture but I voted most landscape pictures stating 2005 low because it was easy.  the cloud looks like a dragon spewing smoke.', '2005-08-12 15:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
