(1607351, 216098, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Met the Challenge (I think a photo of this in a time capsule with the year would depict the year/era well).  I like the effect you have done, you got very close to how they looked.  Criticism; whilst you have achieved a fairly authentic look/feel to this era in my opinion, I think sepia may have added more authenticity.  I could ''nitpick'' the hay bales looking so ''machined'' but maybe back then they did get them looking like that (wasn''t around).  The only other thing might be a slightly closer ''framing'', so as just getting the horse and barn.  Well done though, a good ''era capture''.</td>', '6 - Met the Challenge (I think a photo of this in a time capsule with the year would depict the year/era well).  I like the effect you have done, you got very close to how they looked.  Criticism; whilst you have achieved a fairly authentic look/feel to this era in my opinion, I think sepia may have added more authenticity.  I could ''nitpick'' the hay bales looking so ''machined'' but maybe back then they did get them looking like that (wasn''t around).  The only other thing might be a slightly closer ''framing'', so as just getting the horse and barn.  Well done though, a good ''era capture''.', '2005-08-13 01:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607355, 214125, 20850, '<td valign="top">nice shot..9</td>', 'nice shot..9', '2005-08-13 01:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607358, 214798, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good effort to capture the era/year/feel for the Challenge (in my opinion, a shot of this put in a time capsule for this year gives a good depiction).  Criticism; whilst I do really like this shot and the feel, I''ll state the obvious and go against what you are obviously trying to achieve - for me, it is too dark.  Especially on the pump, if that just had a touch more ''detail'', it would make it a better photograph in my opinion.  It is a fine shot though and the setting is good - even getting more detail on the house(?) or church(?) would lift it more for me, but I think I get your intent, and it still ''fits the Challenge'' just a ''creative'' take, so well done.  Ok, from 6 -&gt; 7.</td>', '7 - Good effort to capture the era/year/feel for the Challenge (in my opinion, a shot of this put in a time capsule for this year gives a good depiction).  Criticism; whilst I do really like this shot and the feel, I''ll state the obvious and go against what you are obviously trying to achieve - for me, it is too dark.  Especially on the pump, if that just had a touch more ''detail'', it would make it a better photograph in my opinion.  It is a fine shot though and the setting is good - even getting more detail on the house(?) or church(?) would lift it more for me, but I think I get your intent, and it still ''fits the Challenge'' just a ''creative'' take, so well done.  Ok, from 6 -> 7.', '2005-08-13 01:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607364, 215996, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good effort to capture the era for the Challenge (in my opinion, this shot put into a time capsule for this year captures it well - albeit ''highly stylized).  Criticism;  whilst I like the dummies - ''he'' looks less real than ''her'', so for me, detracts.  So, in my opinion, either a blurring out more or a cropping out of him, would make this a better photograph in my opinion.  I like the colors and the contrast, the lighting too, but just a tiny bit ''blown'' (but I''m guessing that''s what you were going for) in my opinion.  Creative though, you went to a lot of trouble.</td>', '6 - Good effort to capture the era for the Challenge (in my opinion, this shot put into a time capsule for this year captures it well - albeit ''highly stylized).  Criticism;  whilst I like the dummies - ''he'' looks less real than ''her'', so for me, detracts.  So, in my opinion, either a blurring out more or a cropping out of him, would make this a better photograph in my opinion.  I like the colors and the contrast, the lighting too, but just a tiny bit ''blown'' (but I''m guessing that''s what you were going for) in my opinion.  Creative though, you went to a lot of trouble.', '2005-08-13 01:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607367, 214516, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good effort to meet the Challenge (picture of this in a time capsule for this year depicts the era well for future generations).  I like the b/w or sepia?.  Like how you have captured just about the entire room, including ceiling.  Criticism; for me, either a softening, or, more detail (especially on the lady) would make this a better photograph in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Good effort to meet the Challenge (picture of this in a time capsule for this year depicts the era well for future generations).  I like the b/w or sepia?.  Like how you have captured just about the entire room, including ceiling.  Criticism; for me, either a softening, or, more detail (especially on the lady) would make this a better photograph in my opinion.', '2005-08-13 01:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607373, 215286, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Met the Challenge (a shot of this in a time capsule for this year would depict it well for future generations in my opinion).  Criticism; not sure about the neon signs, if they are ''authentic'' for that era.  I like the angle and ''everydayness'' of this shot, I think that you captured that well.  Given the multitude of colors likely here, the b/w is likely best, not sure if sepia would have done better.  Maybe just a slightly wider angle may have made this a better photograph in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Met the Challenge (a shot of this in a time capsule for this year would depict it well for future generations in my opinion).  Criticism; not sure about the neon signs, if they are ''authentic'' for that era.  I like the angle and ''everydayness'' of this shot, I think that you captured that well.  Given the multitude of colors likely here, the b/w is likely best, not sure if sepia would have done better.  Maybe just a slightly wider angle may have made this a better photograph in my opinion.', '2005-08-13 01:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607383, 215905, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good shot for the Challenge (in my opinion a shot of this into a time capsule for the year depicts the era/feel for future generations well).  I like the b/w or sepia?  Criticism; not sure if you have softened/blurred, and whilst I do like that effect, for me if it were ''crisper'', especially on the wheels (more contrast there too re the white) and on the emblem/crest, would have made this a better photograph in my opinion.  Just a nice ''feel'' to this shot.  I can''t quite discern if it is a ''pick up truck'', if it is, I would like to have seen the tray incorporated for added character.</td>', '7 - Good shot for the Challenge (in my opinion a shot of this into a time capsule for the year depicts the era/feel for future generations well).  I like the b/w or sepia?  Criticism; not sure if you have softened/blurred, and whilst I do like that effect, for me if it were ''crisper'', especially on the wheels (more contrast there too re the white) and on the emblem/crest, would have made this a better photograph in my opinion.  Just a nice ''feel'' to this shot.  I can''t quite discern if it is a ''pick up truck'', if it is, I would like to have seen the tray incorporated for added character.', '2005-08-13 01:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607398, 214505, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good shot to depict the feel/era for the Challenge (in my opinion this shot in a time capsule would do that for future generations).  Criticism; whilst you have obviously applied a few effects (sepia?, grain?), if you had taken them a little further and included perhaps softening too, it may have made this a better photograph in my opinion.  I think her pose / expression is ''classic'' and the dress and doll and basket? (which I would like to see more of) adds the required character to capture this era.  She is getting a little ''lost'' in front of the tree though, with her dark hair in my opinion.  Good effort to capture ''childhood in this era'', in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Good shot to depict the feel/era for the Challenge (in my opinion this shot in a time capsule would do that for future generations).  Criticism; whilst you have obviously applied a few effects (sepia?, grain?), if you had taken them a little further and included perhaps softening too, it may have made this a better photograph in my opinion.  I think her pose / expression is ''classic'' and the dress and doll and basket? (which I would like to see more of) adds the required character to capture this era.  She is getting a little ''lost'' in front of the tree though, with her dark hair in my opinion.  Good effort to capture ''childhood in this era'', in my opinion.', '2005-08-13 02:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607400, 215969, 35827, '<td valign="top">very cool.</td>', 'very cool.', '2005-08-13 02:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607403, 214726, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good idea for capturing an essence of this era for the Challenge (in my opinion a shot of this into a time capsule for this year depicts the era well).  Criticism; as I am sure you both know and are being ''told'', a bigger shot.  Whilst a sepia style for this era would work well I think the colors here are great.  I really like the ultra polish on the metal, especially set against the sky.  A different angle (especially to try to exclude/hide that ''sign'' would make this a better photograph in my opinion.  Also, to be able to include both ''engines''/blades.</td>', '6 - Good idea for capturing an essence of this era for the Challenge (in my opinion a shot of this into a time capsule for this year depicts the era well).  Criticism; as I am sure you both know and are being ''told'', a bigger shot.  Whilst a sepia style for this era would work well I think the colors here are great.  I really like the ultra polish on the metal, especially set against the sky.  A different angle (especially to try to exclude/hide that ''sign'' would make this a better photograph in my opinion.  Also, to be able to include both ''engines''/blades.', '2005-08-13 02:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607405, 215962, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - (up from 4) The concept is good for meeting the Challenge (especially in the true time capsule sense).  Criticism; the little ornaments are getting too lost in my opinion in front of the map.  A different angle may have helped here or just playing around with lighting or composition/arrangement.  The ''base'' perhaps could be something that may ''lift'' this shot more, not sure what, just something that ties in with your ''set'' more, even just color wise.  Perhaps if you had experimented with the lighting you may have been able to introduce more shadow play, which may have made it a better photograph - in my opinion.</td>', '5 - (up from 4) The concept is good for meeting the Challenge (especially in the true time capsule sense).  Criticism; the little ornaments are getting too lost in my opinion in front of the map.  A different angle may have helped here or just playing around with lighting or composition/arrangement.  The ''base'' perhaps could be something that may ''lift'' this shot more, not sure what, just something that ties in with your ''set'' more, even just color wise.  Perhaps if you had experimented with the lighting you may have been able to introduce more shadow play, which may have made it a better photograph - in my opinion.', '2005-08-13 02:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607417, 214995, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Ok, I will comment on this one because I really like this shot.  But - in my opinion your title does not need anything further than 1942 or 1943.  This photo DOES tell a story without the title and a pretty obvious one at that given the flag and uniforms.  In my opinion, just the year would actually make this photo stand out more (not JUST because that was part of the Challenge description, but because of what you have captured.  Again, only commenting because I think you have done well to capture an era and it looks authentic.  A photo of this put into a time capsule for this year, would depict it well for future generations.  Just the year, and it would have been possibly an 8, or 7 from me.  Just MY ''opinion''.</td>', '4 - Ok, I will comment on this one because I really like this shot.  But - in my opinion your title does not need anything further than 1942 or 1943.  This photo DOES tell a story without the title and a pretty obvious one at that given the flag and uniforms.  In my opinion, just the year would actually make this photo stand out more (not JUST because that was part of the Challenge description, but because of what you have captured.  Again, only commenting because I think you have done well to capture an era and it looks authentic.  A photo of this put into a time capsule for this year, would depict it well for future generations.  Just the year, and it would have been possibly an 8, or 7 from me.  Just MY ''opinion''.', '2005-08-13 02:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
