(1607600, 215861, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Challenge met (I consider a photo of this put in a time capsule would depict this era for future generations).  Criticism; whilst I am normally an advocate of unusual angles, I think you have detracted from the potential here.  I have my suspicions you may have done this as that may be a ''modern'' phone in the ''old style''(?), so good ''hiding'' if that is the case.  The ear piece is not in focus and if that were in focus and possibly just a more side on angle, including the flask, and a little straightening, especially seeing as you have that ''frame'' in the ''set'', would have made this a better photograph in my opinion.  The sepia looks good. edit: typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-08-17 05:10:21.</i></td>', '6 - Challenge met (I consider a photo of this put in a time capsule would depict this era for future generations).  Criticism; whilst I am normally an advocate of unusual angles, I think you have detracted from the potential here.  I have my suspicions you may have done this as that may be a ''modern'' phone in the ''old style''(?), so good ''hiding'' if that is the case.  The ear piece is not in focus and if that were in focus and possibly just a more side on angle, including the flask, and a little straightening, especially seeing as you have that ''frame'' in the ''set'', would have made this a better photograph in my opinion.  The sepia looks good. edit: typo', '2005-08-13 07:37:45.000000', '2005-08-17 06:10:21.000000', 1),
(1607601, 214262, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Met the Challenge in my opinion (I think a photo of this in a time capsule would depict this era for future generations, unless these were in fact going in a ''large'' time capsule).  Criticism; whilst I can see you have applied some effects for an ''aged'' look, I would like to see more of that.  More softening perhaps, or even a sharper but more ''grainy'' feel.  Good choice of childhood ''feel'' subjects though that look fairly authentic to me.</td>', '6 - Met the Challenge in my opinion (I think a photo of this in a time capsule would depict this era for future generations, unless these were in fact going in a ''large'' time capsule).  Criticism; whilst I can see you have applied some effects for an ''aged'' look, I would like to see more of that.  More softening perhaps, or even a sharper but more ''grainy'' feel.  Good choice of childhood ''feel'' subjects though that look fairly authentic to me.', '2005-08-13 07:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607602, 215879, 40797, '<td valign="top">Perfect representation of a 1875 school house.  I like the way the desks leads the eye to the chalk board. Nice clean picture.</td>', 'Perfect representation of a 1875 school house.  I like the way the desks leads the eye to the chalk board. Nice clean picture.', '2005-08-13 07:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607603, 215699, 40797, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture of a sunset.</td>', 'Beautiful picture of a sunset.', '2005-08-13 07:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607604, 215785, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Met the Challenge, especially in the true time capsule ''contents'' aspect, even though a photo of this put into said year time capsule would depict the era well for future generations as well.  Criticism; whilst I do like this shot and the simplicity of it, I would like to see a little more character ''items'' included as well.  I can see the effects you have applied and I think for these ''items'' in my opinion, there is too much grain, or, not sure, sepia a touch more yellow, just not getting that real ''old style'' photograph feel to me.  Maybe yes playing with the shadows, incorporating them more, may have also added an extra something to this shot and made it better in my opinion.  Perhaps, a darker frame, not sure.</td>', '6 - Met the Challenge, especially in the true time capsule ''contents'' aspect, even though a photo of this put into said year time capsule would depict the era well for future generations as well.  Criticism; whilst I do like this shot and the simplicity of it, I would like to see a little more character ''items'' included as well.  I can see the effects you have applied and I think for these ''items'' in my opinion, there is too much grain, or, not sure, sepia a touch more yellow, just not getting that real ''old style'' photograph feel to me.  Maybe yes playing with the shadows, incorporating them more, may have also added an extra something to this shot and made it better in my opinion.  Perhaps, a darker frame, not sure.', '2005-08-13 07:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607605, 215847, 40797, '<td valign="top">Love the expression on your subjects face. Nice clean picture.</td>', 'Love the expression on your subjects face. Nice clean picture.', '2005-08-13 07:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
