(1607610, 215992, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Met the Challenge (for me, a photo of this put in a time capsule for this year would depict the era/feel for future generations).  Criticism; whilst I do like the color treatment, and also that you have retained the colors rather than gone for the sepia or b/w, for me I find, especially the seemingly oversized uniform (and no trousers?) a little detracting from the overall picture.  Perhaps if that ''subject'' were not so sharp, or well lit, not sure, but may have made this a better photograph in my opinion.  Perhaps it is a ''story'' being told here, that includes the surrounding objects like the bike, and what looks like an overturned pram(?) not sure, but I am fairly certain it is a ''moment in time'' at a ''historical event'' in an ''era'' (40''s) that you are capturing and I think you have succeeded in that, if I am correct in that interpretation.  I can see you have made a lot of effort here and it shows in your shot.  I like the texture capture on the walls, etc too and the ''darkness'' around them at the top.</td>', '7 - Met the Challenge (for me, a photo of this put in a time capsule for this year would depict the era/feel for future generations).  Criticism; whilst I do like the color treatment, and also that you have retained the colors rather than gone for the sepia or b/w, for me I find, especially the seemingly oversized uniform (and no trousers?) a little detracting from the overall picture.  Perhaps if that ''subject'' were not so sharp, or well lit, not sure, but may have made this a better photograph in my opinion.  Perhaps it is a ''story'' being told here, that includes the surrounding objects like the bike, and what looks like an overturned pram(?) not sure, but I am fairly certain it is a ''moment in time'' at a ''historical event'' in an ''era'' (40''s) that you are capturing and I think you have succeeded in that, if I am correct in that interpretation.  I can see you have made a lot of effort here and it shows in your shot.  I like the texture capture on the walls, etc too and the ''darkness'' around them at the top.', '2005-08-13 07:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607612, 213464, 30791, '<td valign="top">dang! 8</td>', 'dang! 8', '2005-08-13 07:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
