(1607624, 214464, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Met the Challenge, but by a little ''stretch'' in my opinion.  I like the concept, ''the morning reading the paper etc etc'' - I guess ''he'' had no tv.. Criticism; whilst it is a seemingly well ''set'' shot, and a good one (in fact to me, looks like a still from a movie), for the Challenge I am interpreting it as either a photograph of the contents of a time capsule, or an era that a photograph of, could go into a time capsule that would depict said era for future generations, so I find it hard to relate either of those (barring the newspaper) to this shot.</td>', '6 - Met the Challenge, but by a little ''stretch'' in my opinion.  I like the concept, ''the morning reading the paper etc etc'' - I guess ''he'' had no tv.. Criticism; whilst it is a seemingly well ''set'' shot, and a good one (in fact to me, looks like a still from a movie), for the Challenge I am interpreting it as either a photograph of the contents of a time capsule, or an era that a photograph of, could go into a time capsule that would depict said era for future generations, so I find it hard to relate either of those (barring the newspaper) to this shot.', '2005-08-13 08:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607625, 214271, 40797, '<td valign="top">You captured the 1960''s. I like your subject. IMO, wish it was more in focus- could just be eyes tho. Good Luck</td>', 'You captured the 1960''s. I like your subject. IMO, wish it was more in focus- could just be eyes tho. Good Luck', '2005-08-13 08:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607627, 215677, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Met the Challenge (in an unusual but valid way - in my opinion, by putting a photo of this in a time capsule for this year  to show that some things remain the same, ''over'' eras, to future generations).  It is a kind of ''paradox'' and for that I think it is creative and unusual and yes ''out of the box'', for it is still ''true'' to 2005, though of course not ''indicative'' of the ''general way of life'' "to depict the era to future generations".  Criticism; whilst I think the b/w works well here, especially with the seeming ''intent'', given the year, maybe a ''color'' shot of this, not sure.  Of course, for me you could have put possibly 1950? (or whatever year that bike is), but I think I understand your intent.  I also wonder whether a black frame may have been more dramatic.  In my opinion it is a stretch on the ''spirit'' of the Challenge, but it is still realistic enough to be ''acceptable'' in my opinion, etc etc.  Perhaps a little more definition on the bike may have made this a better photograph, in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Met the Challenge (in an unusual but valid way - in my opinion, by putting a photo of this in a time capsule for this year  to show that some things remain the same, ''over'' eras, to future generations).  It is a kind of ''paradox'' and for that I think it is creative and unusual and yes ''out of the box'', for it is still ''true'' to 2005, though of course not ''indicative'' of the ''general way of life'' "to depict the era to future generations".  Criticism; whilst I think the b/w works well here, especially with the seeming ''intent'', given the year, maybe a ''color'' shot of this, not sure.  Of course, for me you could have put possibly 1950? (or whatever year that bike is), but I think I understand your intent.  I also wonder whether a black frame may have been more dramatic.  In my opinion it is a stretch on the ''spirit'' of the Challenge, but it is still realistic enough to be ''acceptable'' in my opinion, etc etc.  Perhaps a little more definition on the bike may have made this a better photograph, in my opinion.', '2005-08-13 08:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607628, 215496, 40797, '<td valign="top">Cool picture, nice, crisp, and clean. IMO I would of liked to seen the unicorns on top centered a little more. The head on the left unicorn is missing. Excellent Job</td>', 'Cool picture, nice, crisp, and clean. IMO I would of liked to seen the unicorns on top centered a little more. The head on the left unicorn is missing. Excellent Job', '2005-08-13 08:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607630, 214825, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Met the Challenge (in my opinion a photo of this put into a time capsule for this year would depict the era for future generations well).  Criticism; if there was a little more sharpness and contrast, and perhaps a slightly different angle, would have made this a better photograph in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Met the Challenge (in my opinion a photo of this put into a time capsule for this year would depict the era for future generations well).  Criticism; if there was a little more sharpness and contrast, and perhaps a slightly different angle, would have made this a better photograph in my opinion.', '2005-08-13 08:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
