(1607634, 216035, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Met the Challenge - but lacks a little in my opinion (for me, a photo of this put into a time capsule would depict a ''feel'' for this era for future generations).  Criticism; whilst I do like the simplicity, given the Challenge I would like to see more ''items''.  I like the feel of the ''subjects'' but just, in my opinion, another ''character'' or two would make this a better photograph for the Challenge in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Met the Challenge - but lacks a little in my opinion (for me, a photo of this put into a time capsule would depict a ''feel'' for this era for future generations).  Criticism; whilst I do like the simplicity, given the Challenge I would like to see more ''items''.  I like the feel of the ''subjects'' but just, in my opinion, another ''character'' or two would make this a better photograph for the Challenge in my opinion.', '2005-08-13 08:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607635, 213945, 40797, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. Good Luck</td>', 'Nice picture. Good Luck', '2005-08-13 08:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607636, 214881, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Met the Challenge (not that I know what ''crest'' that is, ie the ''authenticity'', but a photo of this put in a time capsule would depict a certain feel for this era/year for future generations in my opinion).  Criticism; I do like the ''effects'' applied and really like the way the metal ''shines'', but I think more of the vehicle in the shot (especially headlights), enabling more ''character'', depiction of the era, would make this a better photo in my opinion.</td>', '6 - Met the Challenge (not that I know what ''crest'' that is, ie the ''authenticity'', but a photo of this put in a time capsule would depict a certain feel for this era/year for future generations in my opinion).  Criticism; I do like the ''effects'' applied and really like the way the metal ''shines'', but I think more of the vehicle in the shot (especially headlights), enabling more ''character'', depiction of the era, would make this a better photo in my opinion.', '2005-08-13 08:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607641, 216029, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Met the Challenge (for me a photo of this put into a time capsule for said year would depict a good feel for this era for future generations, even if just for the cars).  Criticism; not much, I think you have done well and the ''neutral'' background and sun through the distant trees do not detract from the image and in fact, complement it.  I think the sepia(?) works well here and adds to the ''character''.  Maybe, a slightly different angle, not sure.</td>', '6 - Met the Challenge (for me a photo of this put into a time capsule for said year would depict a good feel for this era for future generations, even if just for the cars).  Criticism; not much, I think you have done well and the ''neutral'' background and sun through the distant trees do not detract from the image and in fact, complement it.  I think the sepia(?) works well here and adds to the ''character''.  Maybe, a slightly different angle, not sure.', '2005-08-13 08:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
