(1607795, 214611, 27763, '<td valign="top">i feel as if i am magically transported to the year 1866 ;)  nice shot with good natural window light.</td>', 'i feel as if i am magically transported to the year 1866 ;)  nice shot with good natural window light.', '2005-08-13 10:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607797, 214726, 27763, '<td valign="top">too small. should be 640 pixels wide!  otherwise, not a bad shot, although I think i would have tried to get a shot without the big plaque thingy in it.</td>', 'too small. should be 640 pixels wide!  otherwise, not a bad shot, although I think i would have tried to get a shot without the big plaque thingy in it.', '2005-08-13 11:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607799, 215492, 27763, '<td valign="top">it''s funny that you felt compelled to justify the grain in your title!  this is a nice portrait with very nice lighting.  i like the old style santa suit, too.  good job.</td>', 'it''s funny that you felt compelled to justify the grain in your title!  this is a nice portrait with very nice lighting.  i like the old style santa suit, too.  good job.', '2005-08-13 11:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607804, 215301, 27763, '<td valign="top">this should do well.  this picture is of very good technical quality with great natural lighting, and you''ve used a very interesting camera angle.  also, you captured a good moment with good facial expressions on the two guys.  nicely done...  best I''ve seen so far...</td>', 'this should do well.  this picture is of very good technical quality with great natural lighting, and you''ve used a very interesting camera angle.  also, you captured a good moment with good facial expressions on the two guys.  nicely done...  best I''ve seen so far...', '2005-08-13 11:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607808, 214455, 27763, '<td valign="top">that''s how they said the future would be!   i like that you photographed the building from an interesting angle, and you cropped in tightly on a detail of it, rather than including the entire building.</td>', 'that''s how they said the future would be!   i like that you photographed the building from an interesting angle, and you cropped in tightly on a detail of it, rather than including the entire building.', '2005-08-13 11:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607809, 215336, 27763, '<td valign="top">this photo has a nice feeling of depth to it, due to the wings coming into the foreground.  well composed.</td>', 'this photo has a nice feeling of depth to it, due to the wings coming into the foreground.  well composed.', '2005-08-13 11:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607811, 215471, 27763, '<td valign="top">i feel as if i am magically transported to the year 1958 ;)  seriously, though, this does evoke an era, and i like the use of natural light coming in through the back door.  the blurry kitty is a nice touch, too.</td>', 'i feel as if i am magically transported to the year 1958 ;)  seriously, though, this does evoke an era, and i like the use of natural light coming in through the back door.  the blurry kitty is a nice touch, too.', '2005-08-13 11:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607813, 216103, 27763, '<td valign="top">this does not specifically evoke modern times to me.  this condition has existed since the dawn of mankind, not just in modern times.</td>', 'this does not specifically evoke modern times to me.  this condition has existed since the dawn of mankind, not just in modern times.', '2005-08-13 11:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607815, 216035, 27763, '<td valign="top">nice one.</td>', 'nice one.', '2005-08-13 11:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1607821, 215957, 27763, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful photo.  i really like it.  however, it''s a bit of a stretch to meet the challenge, isn''t it?</td>', 'this is a beautiful photo.  i really like it.  however, it''s a bit of a stretch to meet the challenge, isn''t it?', '2005-08-13 11:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
