(1608001, 215365, 31443, '<td valign="top">Looking at this image away from the fact that I dislike any kind of weapons, it´s a really nice take on a simple subject and the engraved year fits the challenge to a t, well done..</td>', 'Looking at this image away from the fact that I dislike any kind of weapons, it´s a really nice take on a simple subject and the engraved year fits the challenge to a t, well done..', '2005-08-13 13:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
