(1608015, 215970, 31443, '<td valign="top">I remember this time really well because my sister was a teenager and I would watch her empty a hairspray can almost every day into her hair. The portrait is nice but the background would have been better all in one color or white. To limit creases in a sheet like that, light up the background and limit flash usage..</td>', 'I remember this time really well because my sister was a teenager and I would watch her empty a hairspray can almost every day into her hair. The portrait is nice but the background would have been better all in one color or white. To limit creases in a sheet like that, light up the background and limit flash usage..', '2005-08-13 13:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608016, 213955, 39349, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see the sky not so blown out. Otherwise nice shot.</td>', 'Would have liked to see the sky not so blown out. Otherwise nice shot.', '2005-08-13 13:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608021, 215181, 39349, '<td valign="top">OMG this is a beautiful shot! I hope this does well in the challenge, it''s one of my favs! 10</td>', 'OMG this is a beautiful shot! I hope this does well in the challenge, it''s one of my favs! 10', '2005-08-13 13:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
