(1608540, 215791, 40667, '<td valign="top">great... was that taken with a fish eye? great job though~!</td>', 'great... was that taken with a fish eye? great job though~!', '2005-08-13 20:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608552, 216002, 40667, '<td valign="top">great job~! i''ve only seen a couple of record type photos~!</td>', 'great job~! i''ve only seen a couple of record type photos~!', '2005-08-13 20:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608568, 216103, 42269, '<td valign="top">there is something very powerful about this image</td>', 'there is something very powerful about this image', '2005-08-13 20:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608569, 214772, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - I like the concept of this shot for this year but in my opinion, that is all you needed (''should have'') in the title, just the year.  Criticism; also given the year depiction, a color shot would have been better in my opinion.  An original shot though.. a photo of this put into a time capsule for this year would depict ''an aspect'' of this year for future generations.  Color and just the year, and likely 7 if not 8 from me.</td>', '4 - I like the concept of this shot for this year but in my opinion, that is all you needed (''should have'') in the title, just the year.  Criticism; also given the year depiction, a color shot would have been better in my opinion.  An original shot though.. a photo of this put into a time capsule for this year would depict ''an aspect'' of this year for future generations.  Color and just the year, and likely 7 if not 8 from me.', '2005-08-13 20:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608578, 215613, 42269, '<td valign="top">i almost wish i could see his face, but the silohette is cool</td>', 'i almost wish i could see his face, but the silohette is cool', '2005-08-13 21:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608586, 215251, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - In my opinion you ''lost points'' with the elaboration, just the year would suffice and as I read the Challenge (''should be'').  Criticism; I like what you have chosen to shoot here but would like to see more of the little ''book''(?) to add more ''feel'' to this photo.  Perhaps even b/w or sepia but yes I know the Coke thimble might get lost a little.  With just the title, likely a 7 from me (as a photo of this put into said year time capsule, would depict the era for future generations, not to mention these subjects would likely would fit into a time capsule as they are). edit:typos<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-08-21 20:31:12.</i></td>', '4 - In my opinion you ''lost points'' with the elaboration, just the year would suffice and as I read the Challenge (''should be'').  Criticism; I like what you have chosen to shoot here but would like to see more of the little ''book''(?) to add more ''feel'' to this photo.  Perhaps even b/w or sepia but yes I know the Coke thimble might get lost a little.  With just the title, likely a 7 from me (as a photo of this put into said year time capsule, would depict the era for future generations, not to mention these subjects would likely would fit into a time capsule as they are). edit:typos', '2005-08-13 21:03:41.000000', '2005-08-21 21:31:12.000000', 1),
(1608594, 215399, 41129, '<td valign="top">nice photo.... cool old bike...</td>', 'nice photo.... cool old bike...', '2005-08-13 21:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608607, 215799, 41129, '<td valign="top">time capsule is the theme,,, how can we put a photo depicting the future in a time capsule.... sorry, not fitting of the theme to me...</td>', 'time capsule is the theme,,, how can we put a photo depicting the future in a time capsule.... sorry, not fitting of the theme to me...', '2005-08-13 21:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608609, 213880, 40922, '<td valign="top">Represents more of a "time of life" than an "era in time" Cute tho</td>', 'Represents more of a "time of life" than an "era in time" Cute tho', '2005-08-13 21:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608611, 214846, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - I like this and think you met the Challenge in the respect that a shot of this put into a time capsule for said year would depict the era quite well for future generations.  Criticism; for true ''authenticity'', I will nitpick the phone, and perhaps the shape of the Coke bottle, but yes that is nitpicking, but ''striving for perfection'' is the aim, for me at least.  I like the shadow at the fore, and would like to see you have incorporated that more.  I think the b/w works well here but a different angle, more ''dramatic'', may have made this a better photograph in my opinion.</td>', '5 - I like this and think you met the Challenge in the respect that a shot of this put into a time capsule for said year would depict the era quite well for future generations.  Criticism; for true ''authenticity'', I will nitpick the phone, and perhaps the shape of the Coke bottle, but yes that is nitpicking, but ''striving for perfection'' is the aim, for me at least.  I like the shadow at the fore, and would like to see you have incorporated that more.  I think the b/w works well here but a different angle, more ''dramatic'', may have made this a better photograph in my opinion.', '2005-08-13 21:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608612, 214702, 41129, '<td valign="top">time capsule is the theme... not "predict the future"... lol... sorry but like i have put to others, how can we put a photo of us predicting the future into a time capsule for future people to see what the PAST was like...</td>', 'time capsule is the theme... not "predict the future"... lol... sorry but like i have put to others, how can we put a photo of us predicting the future into a time capsule for future people to see what the PAST was like...', '2005-08-13 21:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608614, 214631, 41129, '<td valign="top">bit much grain but it kinda works...</td>', 'bit much grain but it kinda works...', '2005-08-13 21:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608615, 215172, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Whilst I do like this shot, for the Challenge, I would like to have seen a closer view of the barn(?).  A photo of this (primarily the barn) put into a time capsule, would give a sense (depiction?) of an aspect of the era/year for future generations. Yes, also, in my opinion, the year was only needed, and in fact would have made more impact to this shot in my opinion.   I like what you have done with the desaturation.  Criticism; less of the rocks, more focus on the barn, even enhancing the ''barrenness'' would have made this a better photograph in my opinion.</td>', '4 - Whilst I do like this shot, for the Challenge, I would like to have seen a closer view of the barn(?).  A photo of this (primarily the barn) put into a time capsule, would give a sense (depiction?) of an aspect of the era/year for future generations. Yes, also, in my opinion, the year was only needed, and in fact would have made more impact to this shot in my opinion.   I like what you have done with the desaturation.  Criticism; less of the rocks, more focus on the barn, even enhancing the ''barrenness'' would have made this a better photograph in my opinion.', '2005-08-13 21:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608624, 216110, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - I like the concept here and I think that a photo of this put into a time capsule for said year would depict the era quite well for future generations, therefore met the Challenge.  Criticism; for true ''authenticity'' the ''fashion'' is not quite right in my opinion, and in my opinion, if you had used just shirts or something ''neglibible'' would have made this a better photograph in my opinion.  I like how you got the suds etc, and the setup.  I wonder if b/w or sepia might have worked better.  A slightly wider angle would have also been better, to get the bigger picture of the ''washing'', in my opinion, etc etc.</td>', '5 - I like the concept here and I think that a photo of this put into a time capsule for said year would depict the era quite well for future generations, therefore met the Challenge.  Criticism; for true ''authenticity'' the ''fashion'' is not quite right in my opinion, and in my opinion, if you had used just shirts or something ''neglibible'' would have made this a better photograph in my opinion.  I like how you got the suds etc, and the setup.  I wonder if b/w or sepia might have worked better.  A slightly wider angle would have also been better, to get the bigger picture of the ''washing'', in my opinion, etc etc.', '2005-08-13 21:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608637, 214236, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Met the Challenge (I think a photo of this put into a time capsule for said year depicts the era well for future generations).  Criticism; I would like to see either a slightly ''wider'' angle, incorporating the roof, else a tighter one, with just the ''eave''.  All the ''subjects'' look pretty authentic to me (maybe the pump?).  As for b/w or sepia, not sure on that, I like the colors, but maybe the desaturation may have made it more ''dramatic'', not sure.</td>', '6 - Met the Challenge (I think a photo of this put into a time capsule for said year depicts the era well for future generations).  Criticism; I would like to see either a slightly ''wider'' angle, incorporating the roof, else a tighter one, with just the ''eave''.  All the ''subjects'' look pretty authentic to me (maybe the pump?).  As for b/w or sepia, not sure on that, I like the colors, but maybe the desaturation may have made it more ''dramatic'', not sure.', '2005-08-13 21:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608648, 213309, 37544, '<td valign="top">where is the flapper dress? gangsters? This doesn''t look like 1920 to me. Sorry</td>', 'where is the flapper dress? gangsters? This doesn''t look like 1920 to me. Sorry', '2005-08-13 21:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608652, 214810, 30791, '<td valign="top">10 from me!<br/>this is awesome!</td>', '10 from me!this is awesome!', '2005-08-13 21:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608653, 214798, 37544, '<td valign="top">very artistic-I like it!</td>', 'very artistic-I like it!', '2005-08-13 21:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608654, 214236, 35517, '<td valign="top">great shot.. i love the little old petrol stations.... i also like the fact you kept it colour.... congrats..9</td>', 'great shot.. i love the little old petrol stations.... i also like the fact you kept it colour.... congrats..9', '2005-08-13 21:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608655, 215960, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - I like the concept but even at (in my opinion and interpretation of the Challenge, a photo of this put into a time capsule to depict the era for future generations) a little stretch I ''don''t buy it'' as a true depiction.  Criticism; The people (tourists?) are way too distracting/detracting for me.  The color treatment, while interesting, and has potential, doesn''t work here in my opinion.  Maybe if you had a different angle or, a different crop, blurred out the ''people'', might have made this better in my opinion.  That said, I would also like to see a lot more definition and detail on the castle, so perhaps closer with that sky as the backdrop, not sure.  edit: typo/grammar<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-08-17 08:19:44.</i></td>', '4 - I like the concept but even at (in my opinion and interpretation of the Challenge, a photo of this put into a time capsule to depict the era for future generations) a little stretch I ''don''t buy it'' as a true depiction.  Criticism; The people (tourists?) are way too distracting/detracting for me.  The color treatment, while interesting, and has potential, doesn''t work here in my opinion.  Maybe if you had a different angle or, a different crop, blurred out the ''people'', might have made this better in my opinion.  That said, I would also like to see a lot more definition and detail on the castle, so perhaps closer with that sky as the backdrop, not sure.  edit: typo/grammar', '2005-08-13 21:42:42.000000', '2005-08-17 09:19:44.000000', 1),
(1608657, 213165, 35517, '<td valign="top">stunning photo...  love the sepia and the angle.... perfect.. 9</td>', 'stunning photo...  love the sepia and the angle.... perfect.. 9', '2005-08-13 21:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608658, 214464, 35517, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT idea... well done.. 9</td>', 'EXCELLENT idea... well done.. 9', '2005-08-13 21:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608659, 215776, 35517, '<td valign="top">WOW... awesome work... 9</td>', 'WOW... awesome work... 9', '2005-08-13 21:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608660, 214741, 35517, '<td valign="top">just gorgeous... love the dark sepia here.. congrats... 9</td>', 'just gorgeous... love the dark sepia here.. congrats... 9', '2005-08-13 21:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608661, 216007, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - I like the concept and that you didn''t ''explain'' your year (don''t need to).  A photo of this in a time capsule would fairly well depict the era for future generations.  Criticism; I would like to see more ''context'' somehow, even a wider angle if that were possible.  I can see you have applied some effects but I think you haven''t quite nailed the ''feel'' I guess you were going for.  Perhaps a little lighter and possibly some grain, not sure.</td>', '5 - I like the concept and that you didn''t ''explain'' your year (don''t need to).  A photo of this in a time capsule would fairly well depict the era for future generations.  Criticism; I would like to see more ''context'' somehow, even a wider angle if that were possible.  I can see you have applied some effects but I think you haven''t quite nailed the ''feel'' I guess you were going for.  Perhaps a little lighter and possibly some grain, not sure.', '2005-08-13 21:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608663, 214846, 35517, '<td valign="top">simplly GORGEOUS.... love the soft colour of sepia here.... well done.. 9</td>', 'simplly GORGEOUS.... love the soft colour of sepia here.... well done.. 9', '2005-08-13 21:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608665, 215302, 35517, '<td valign="top">very very nice... i love  how you kept this one with a bit of colour...9</td>', 'very very nice... i love  how you kept this one with a bit of colour...9', '2005-08-13 21:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608670, 216003, 30791, '<td valign="top">wonderful lighting and exposure!<br/>10</td>', 'wonderful lighting and exposure!10', '2005-08-13 21:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608685, 215668, 37544, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how this picture will remind people of 1950.</td>', 'I don''t see how this picture will remind people of 1950.', '2005-08-13 21:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608687, 215124, 37544, '<td valign="top">this would have rec a higher vote from me if you would have used real people.</td>', 'this would have rec a higher vote from me if you would have used real people.', '2005-08-13 21:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1608691, 215994, 37544, '<td valign="top">great building, wish that the top wasn''t cut off though.</td>', 'great building, wish that the top wasn''t cut off though.', '2005-08-13 22:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
