(1609121, 215636, 36931, '<td valign="top">Genius !! though that''s the nostalgia coming out in me !! (I wish I still had mine!)<br/>Have given this a 7 purely because this is one of the only photos that has really made me think back to that time..almost!!! <br/>(I believe the C64C came out around ''86-87? - but don''t quote me.. I know it was a little later than ''84..)<br/>Still - excellent!! :):)<br/></td>', 'Genius !! though that''s the nostalgia coming out in me !! (I wish I still had mine!)Have given this a 7 purely because this is one of the only photos that has really made me think back to that time..almost!!! (I believe the C64C came out around ''86-87? - but don''t quote me.. I know it was a little later than ''84..)Still - excellent!! :):)', '2005-08-14 02:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
