(1609547, 215758, 14736, '<td valign="top">I don''t really feel like this image conveys the year 2005, however as a photo by itself I like this.  The cmposition is great  and I love that cord/wire draping on the second step.  There is some graininess to the image that I am uncomfortable with.  I would either go with more grain or none at all.</td>', 'I don''t really feel like this image conveys the year 2005, however as a photo by itself I like this.  The cmposition is great  and I love that cord/wire draping on the second step.  There is some graininess to the image that I am uncomfortable with.  I would either go with more grain or none at all.', '2005-08-14 11:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
