(1610184, 214810, 41675, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Had this been in black and white I would have scored it higher. Nicely done.</td>', 'Cool shot. Had this been in black and white I would have scored it higher. Nicely done.', '2005-08-14 20:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
