(1610464, 215982, 25232, '<td valign="top">That was 1968, not 1964. Most Americans didn''t have a clue or a care about what was going on in Vietnam in ''64.<br/> <br/>A little too purple for my taste and the on camera flash should be moved off camera, diffused or done away with. Background clutter is also a problem. Other then all that I think you had a good idea.</td>', 'That was 1968, not 1964. Most Americans didn''t have a clue or a care about what was going on in Vietnam in ''64. A little too purple for my taste and the on camera flash should be moved off camera, diffused or done away with. Background clutter is also a problem. Other then all that I think you had a good idea.', '2005-08-14 23:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1610467, 215857, 25232, '<td valign="top">Great composition.</td>', 'Great composition.', '2005-08-14 23:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
