(1611250, 214147, 41106, '<td valign="top">This image is reminiscent of days gone by...when children used imagination to build castles and empires with a few boards on a tree...when they believed they were protected overseerers by virtue of their height above the ground where all else roamed.  Additionally, the sepia tone and black diffused bordering add to the nastalgia.  If the intemt pf  time capsules is to capture a past moment for future reference, then this image is highly successful.</td>', 'This image is reminiscent of days gone by...when children used imagination to build castles and empires with a few boards on a tree...when they believed they were protected overseerers by virtue of their height above the ground where all else roamed.  Additionally, the sepia tone and black diffused bordering add to the nastalgia.  If the intemt pf  time capsules is to capture a past moment for future reference, then this image is highly successful.', '2005-08-15 02:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1611266, 215298, 41106, '<td valign="top">The progression of time can be inferred by comparing the babe foot to the larger hand, but otherwise this image...while delightful....is not necessarily the most effective way to freeze a moment of time into a capsule.  Indeed, it better portrays continual time....</td>', 'The progression of time can be inferred by comparing the babe foot to the larger hand, but otherwise this image...while delightful....is not necessarily the most effective way to freeze a moment of time into a capsule.  Indeed, it better portrays continual time....', '2005-08-15 02:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
