(1612470, 214772, 40355, '<td valign="top">Not a big fan of the sepia coloration on this one.  It looks too faded, IMP, and the person starts to get lost in the busy background.  For instance, the hydrant is really hard to see at first.  Still, it screams 2001!    7</td>', 'Not a big fan of the sepia coloration on this one.  It looks too faded, IMP, and the person starts to get lost in the busy background.  For instance, the hydrant is really hard to see at first.  Still, it screams 2001!    7', '2005-08-15 15:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
