(1612660, 215790, 40355, '<td valign="top">This looks like a necklace charm.  If you had burried the top end a bit, so that it looked like more of a "discovery" and less like jewelry, it would have improved some.  Also, IMO at least, a bit of an angle to it, and different light would have helped.  Still though, very cool! 7</td>', 'This looks like a necklace charm.  If you had burried the top end a bit, so that it looked like more of a "discovery" and less like jewelry, it would have improved some.  Also, IMO at least, a bit of an angle to it, and different light would have helped.  Still though, very cool! 7', '2005-08-15 16:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1612661, 214596, 40355, '<td valign="top">Oh my....she looks like she just stepped off the boat!</td>', 'Oh my....she looks like she just stepped off the boat!', '2005-08-15 16:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
