(1613200, 214810, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect!  It seems as if you''ve intentionally panned beyond the typical freeze-subject pan...and to good effect! ( I recently tried this with carousel horses with so-so results.)<br/>On the down side, the thick frame is not necessar and seems to detract from the delicate lines of the harnesses.  It would be nice if there were more of the chariots in the frame as my eye keeps traveling right in hopes to see a bit more.<br/>Overall, this appears to be a successful technique worth exploring further.</td>', 'Interesting effect!  It seems as if you''ve intentionally panned beyond the typical freeze-subject pan...and to good effect! ( I recently tried this with carousel horses with so-so results.)On the down side, the thick frame is not necessar and seems to detract from the delicate lines of the harnesses.  It would be nice if there were more of the chariots in the frame as my eye keeps traveling right in hopes to see a bit more.Overall, this appears to be a successful technique worth exploring further.', '2005-08-15 19:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
