(1613502, 215485, 42198, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I can''t see what year this represents - It could be any year, and so wouldn''t mean much in a time capsule. Imaginative and vivid shot though - I love the colours. Just a pity it''s so out of place in this particular challenge.</td>', 'Sorry, but I can''t see what year this represents - It could be any year, and so wouldn''t mean much in a time capsule. Imaginative and vivid shot though - I love the colours. Just a pity it''s so out of place in this particular challenge.', '2005-08-15 22:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613508, 214193, 42198, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I don''t see how this meets the challenge. Flowers are not specific or representative of any year. It will mean nothing to someone opening up a time capsule. Apart from that, nice shot. Vivid colours, good focus, reasonable DOF. Twig on the left is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Sorry, but I don''t see how this meets the challenge. Flowers are not specific or representative of any year. It will mean nothing to someone opening up a time capsule. Apart from that, nice shot. Vivid colours, good focus, reasonable DOF. Twig on the left is a bit distracting.', '2005-08-15 22:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613509, 214726, 11738, '<td valign="top">Too bad this image is so small.  Would have been nice to look at a little larger.  Check the "Learn" section on th website to see how to produce 150kb images that approach the 640 pixels max size.</td>', 'Too bad this image is so small.  Would have been nice to look at a little larger.  Check the "Learn" section on th website to see how to produce 150kb images that approach the 640 pixels max size.', '2005-08-15 22:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613511, 214384, 42198, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I can''t see how this is representative of the year ''2005'' - It could be any year, and so wouldn''t mean much in a time capsule. You''ve nicely captured the ray coming through the clouds though. Not too sure about having just a part of the land visible in the bottom corner like that. I''d say have the foreground visible all the way across to keep things in perspective.</td>', 'Sorry, but I can''t see how this is representative of the year ''2005'' - It could be any year, and so wouldn''t mean much in a time capsule. You''ve nicely captured the ray coming through the clouds though. Not too sure about having just a part of the land visible in the bottom corner like that. I''d say have the foreground visible all the way across to keep things in perspective.', '2005-08-15 22:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613514, 216005, 11738, '<td valign="top">Yellow cast is a bit over the top as the grass seems to have way too much yellow in it.</td>', 'Yellow cast is a bit over the top as the grass seems to have way too much yellow in it.', '2005-08-15 22:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613515, 215577, 42198, '<td valign="top">Could be 1960''s, 70''s, or 80''s... Although his haircut says ''90''s''  lol  .... This shot seems to be more about patriotism than representing any particular year. Nicely composed. The crop at the bottom to show just his eyes was a brave decision! but I think it works. Makes it stand out.</td>', 'Could be 1960''s, 70''s, or 80''s... Although his haircut says ''90''s''  lol  .... This shot seems to be more about patriotism than representing any particular year. Nicely composed. The crop at the bottom to show just his eyes was a brave decision! but I think it works. Makes it stand out.', '2005-08-15 22:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613518, 214776, 42198, '<td valign="top">Image is too small to tell what it represents (i.e. can''t read the writing on the headstone). And there''s no year in the title either, so I can''t see how this is really relevant to the challenge. - Besides, the headstone will probably outlast the photo in the time capsule anyway! - Composition is good, focus and DOF look okay - although image is too small to tell properly.</td>', 'Image is too small to tell what it represents (i.e. can''t read the writing on the headstone). And there''s no year in the title either, so I can''t see how this is really relevant to the challenge. - Besides, the headstone will probably outlast the photo in the time capsule anyway! - Composition is good, focus and DOF look okay - although image is too small to tell properly.', '2005-08-15 22:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613524, 215799, 42198, '<td valign="top">I can''t see how this is relevant to the challenge, sorry! This photo could represent any year, not just 2023. I don''t get the meteor reference either. Although on the positive side, it''s an interesting composition - solitary tree just nicely offset to the left works quite well. Some exposure issues on the sky (centre-bottom)</td>', 'I can''t see how this is relevant to the challenge, sorry! This photo could represent any year, not just 2023. I don''t get the meteor reference either. Although on the positive side, it''s an interesting composition - solitary tree just nicely offset to the left works quite well. Some exposure issues on the sky (centre-bottom)', '2005-08-15 22:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613527, 213895, 42198, '<td valign="top">Great shot - But I just can''t see how it relates to the challenge, sorry! It would perhaps be intended in a time capsule for the baby in there? :-) Excellent use of light/shadows. And a fantastic composition/crop.</td>', 'Great shot - But I just can''t see how it relates to the challenge, sorry! It would perhaps be intended in a time capsule for the baby in there? :-) Excellent use of light/shadows. And a fantastic composition/crop.', '2005-08-15 22:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613531, 216013, 42198, '<td valign="top">Just the mangled door by itself would have been better. There''s too much going on in the background. At first view I couldn''t tell but it looks like this was taken in a museum with a photograph hanging in the background? - Pity about that, I think the background really detracts from this. Lighting is a bit harsh - although if it was in a museum you probably didn''t have much control over that! - On the positive side, this was a great idea for a ''time capsule'' challenge. Sums up 2001 very well.</td>', 'Just the mangled door by itself would have been better. There''s too much going on in the background. At first view I couldn''t tell but it looks like this was taken in a museum with a photograph hanging in the background? - Pity about that, I think the background really detracts from this. Lighting is a bit harsh - although if it was in a museum you probably didn''t have much control over that! - On the positive side, this was a great idea for a ''time capsule'' challenge. Sums up 2001 very well.', '2005-08-15 22:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613535, 216006, 42198, '<td valign="top">I can''t see how this represents any particular year, so is a bit out of place in this challenge. - It could be any year, and so wouldn''t mean much in a time capsule. Good shot though. Moon and venus conjunction? - On second look I think I understand where you''re coming from - is this a biblical reference?</td>', 'I can''t see how this represents any particular year, so is a bit out of place in this challenge. - It could be any year, and so wouldn''t mean much in a time capsule. Good shot though. Moon and venus conjunction? - On second look I think I understand where you''re coming from - is this a biblical reference?', '2005-08-15 22:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613619, 216008, 39007, '<td valign="top">Pity you couldn''t find a 80''s style TV, good concept otherwise</td>', 'Pity you couldn''t find a 80''s style TV, good concept otherwise', '2005-08-15 23:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613663, 214516, 35786, '<td valign="top">technically I can see no flaws with this image- it fits the challenge perfectly too.  I decided to leave this at a 9 because I want a little something more- like the model to look up as if I was really there too or maybe looking out the window. Something to attach me to her.</td>', 'technically I can see no flaws with this image- it fits the challenge perfectly too.  I decided to leave this at a 9 because I want a little something more- like the model to look up as if I was really there too or maybe looking out the window. Something to attach me to her.', '2005-08-15 23:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613664, 214054, 35786, '<td valign="top">xtra point for making me laugh :0)</td>', 'xtra point for making me laugh :0)', '2005-08-15 23:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613666, 214262, 35786, '<td valign="top">I think you could have done some more levels here, the image is very muted- not getting the full range of tones like you should</td>', 'I think you could have done some more levels here, the image is very muted- not getting the full range of tones like you should', '2005-08-15 23:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613797, 214180, 42234, '<td valign="top">I love this photograph.  The years 1977 and 1978 have a very special place in my heart although my life was barely beginning.  The nostalgia included in the compilation is heartwarming.  For someone who enjoys the late 70''s, this picture is evokes emotion.</td>', 'I love this photograph.  The years 1977 and 1978 have a very special place in my heart although my life was barely beginning.  The nostalgia included in the compilation is heartwarming.  For someone who enjoys the late 70''s, this picture is evokes emotion.', '2005-08-16 00:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613805, 214156, 42234, '<td valign="top">This picture is fantastic.  It''d make a great poster.  I know plenty of 80''s babies that would smile big at seeing this picture.</td>', 'This picture is fantastic.  It''d make a great poster.  I know plenty of 80''s babies that would smile big at seeing this picture.', '2005-08-16 01:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613809, 216103, 42234, '<td valign="top">At first glance this picture is disturbingly moving.  Congratulations on evoking an emotion in someone you will never meet.  Although I wouldn''t hang this picture on my wall, it is a powerful commentary on our socitey and it''s helpless.</td>', 'At first glance this picture is disturbingly moving.  Congratulations on evoking an emotion in someone you will never meet.  Although I wouldn''t hang this picture on my wall, it is a powerful commentary on our socitey and it''s helpless.', '2005-08-16 01:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613815, 214464, 42234, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  This picture rocks.  I always wondered what emotions were like for people living during that historical moment.  This totally satisfies my curiosity.  Great job!</td>', 'Fantastic!  This picture rocks.  I always wondered what emotions were like for people living during that historical moment.  This totally satisfies my curiosity.  Great job!', '2005-08-16 01:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613818, 215864, 42234, '<td valign="top">As a collector of antique cameras, I enjoy this picture.  I wouldn''t call it a winner but it makes me smile and that''s enough for me.</td>', 'As a collector of antique cameras, I enjoy this picture.  I wouldn''t call it a winner but it makes me smile and that''s enough for me.', '2005-08-16 01:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613821, 216017, 42234, '<td valign="top">I like this photgraph ALOT!  This tombstone is so unique.  The Black &amp; White just makes this picture so much better.  It''s so graphically moving.  I love it!   I hope you do well.</td>', 'I like this photgraph ALOT!  This tombstone is so unique.  The Black & White just makes this picture so much better.  It''s so graphically moving.  I love it!   I hope you do well.', '2005-08-16 01:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613823, 215862, 42234, '<td valign="top">I would''ve liked to have seen this picture in black and white and from a different angle.  The white building in the background is distracting.  Otherwise it''s just an ordinary vacation picture.</td>', 'I would''ve liked to have seen this picture in black and white and from a different angle.  The white building in the background is distracting.  Otherwise it''s just an ordinary vacation picture.', '2005-08-16 01:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613825, 216142, 42234, '<td valign="top">This is great!  I love antique toys.  Love the focus on the face of the puppet and the black background.  Great picture!</td>', 'This is great!  I love antique toys.  Love the focus on the face of the puppet and the black background.  Great picture!', '2005-08-16 01:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613827, 215811, 42234, '<td valign="top">Great portrait but not a time capsule picture.</td>', 'Great portrait but not a time capsule picture.', '2005-08-16 01:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613832, 216083, 42234, '<td valign="top">Now this is a "Time Capsule" photograph.  What a moment in time!  Anyone who knows what this picture is of, knows that we lost a great man that day.  I''ve always wanted to visit this place.  My only suggestion to make this picture timeless would be to make it black and white.  I know plenty of people that would love to purchase a print of this picture.</td>', 'Now this is a "Time Capsule" photograph.  What a moment in time!  Anyone who knows what this picture is of, knows that we lost a great man that day.  I''ve always wanted to visit this place.  My only suggestion to make this picture timeless would be to make it black and white.  I know plenty of people that would love to purchase a print of this picture.', '2005-08-16 01:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613834, 215677, 42234, '<td valign="top">Is that a monk in the background?  I love the oxymoronic nature of this photograph.</td>', 'Is that a monk in the background?  I love the oxymoronic nature of this photograph.', '2005-08-16 01:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613840, 214274, 42234, '<td valign="top">Magical!  Absolutely magical!</td>', 'Magical!  Absolutely magical!', '2005-08-16 01:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1613843, 214995, 42234, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  This is a great picture!  The guy holding the flag kind of looks like George W. Bush...</td>', 'Fantastic!  This is a great picture!  The guy holding the flag kind of looks like George W. Bush...', '2005-08-16 01:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
