(1613855, 214959, 42234, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture.  I love the innocent quality that comes across.  Plus a guy in denim always makes a great subject.</td>', 'This is a great picture.  I love the innocent quality that comes across.  Plus a guy in denim always makes a great subject.', '2005-08-16 01:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
