(1614076, 216103, 31443, '<td valign="top">I''m having difficultiies commenting on this image because it stirs up too much emotion and guilt. The image quality is the best under the circumstances and the most meaningful in b/w. You are brave to post such an image, something I also tend to do and get thrashed for, oh well..</td>', 'I''m having difficultiies commenting on this image because it stirs up too much emotion and guilt. The image quality is the best under the circumstances and the most meaningful in b/w. You are brave to post such an image, something I also tend to do and get thrashed for, oh well..', '2005-08-16 06:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614096, 213895, 41179, '<td valign="top">Such a wonderful photo. The hand shows caring and protection. I love the way only part of the belly is shown, and the fact that the belly is slightly off centre. Also for a mother myself, it brings back memories, of being in that moment.</td>', 'Such a wonderful photo. The hand shows caring and protection. I love the way only part of the belly is shown, and the fact that the belly is slightly off centre. Also for a mother myself, it brings back memories, of being in that moment.', '2005-08-16 07:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
