(1614154, 216102, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice attention to detail with outside distractions.  Nothing reflected in the mirror or visible out the window that would betray the year depicted.  Lighting well balanced.  Composition (interest) is fair.  The ''Winnie the Pooh'' ears are a bit of an attention getter...</td>', 'Nice attention to detail with outside distractions.  Nothing reflected in the mirror or visible out the window that would betray the year depicted.  Lighting well balanced.  Composition (interest) is fair.  The ''Winnie the Pooh'' ears are a bit of an attention getter...', '2005-08-16 08:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614161, 216019, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cool rainbow.  Wouldn''t that castle be in a bit better shape if it was 1315?  ;^)</td>', 'Cool rainbow.  Wouldn''t that castle be in a bit better shape if it was 1315?  ;^)', '2005-08-16 08:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614171, 214959, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great album!  ;^)  Nice use of space in your composition.  Like your choice of B/W to set the mood.  The pose looks a bit forced (I think the album would be a bit tipped back if held naturally while walking).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great album!  ;^)  Nice use of space in your composition.  Like your choice of B/W to set the mood.  The pose looks a bit forced (I think the album would be a bit tipped back if held naturally while walking).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-08-16 09:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
