(1614334, 214008, 11383, '<td valign="top">All in all, not a bad pic, however it really needed more lighting so you can see more of the car. it looks like all you did was use the flash. Still niche choice of subject, but personally I think the title should be "1969 Re-lived in 2005" because the new Mustang is shaped more like the 1969 Mustangs than the 1965.</td>', 'All in all, not a bad pic, however it really needed more lighting so you can see more of the car. it looks like all you did was use the flash. Still niche choice of subject, but personally I think the title should be "1969 Re-lived in 2005" because the new Mustang is shaped more like the 1969 Mustangs than the 1965.', '2005-08-16 10:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
