(1614534, 214995, 40355, '<td valign="top">Remarkable.  This looks like it could almost have come from the actual battle.  Suggestions: perhaps add some grain, or even make it black and white, to add an even more authentic feeling.  9</td>', 'Remarkable.  This looks like it could almost have come from the actual battle.  Suggestions: perhaps add some grain, or even make it black and white, to add an even more authentic feeling.  9', '2005-08-16 12:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
