(1614552, 214521, 40355, '<td valign="top">However you managed to get a picture of this, you did amazing!  &lt;envy&gt;  From a subject standpoint, it is classic.  Photo wise, it retains the feel of a period photo.  Very well done!  10</td>', 'However you managed to get a picture of this, you did amazing!  <envy>  From a subject standpoint, it is classic.  Photo wise, it retains the feel of a period photo.  Very well done!  10', '2005-08-16 12:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
