(1614561, 216041, 40355, '<td valign="top">The shot of the coin is good, but in MHO, has nothing to do with the title.  If you''re going to mention a hydro plant, it might be good to show it.</td>', 'The shot of the coin is good, but in MHO, has nothing to do with the title.  If you''re going to mention a hydro plant, it might be good to show it.', '2005-08-16 12:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
