(1614567, 215425, 40355, '<td valign="top">Great old-style shot, it retains the period feel.  Especially fond of the steam venting!  Very well done!  9</td>', 'Great old-style shot, it retains the period feel.  Especially fond of the steam venting!  Very well done!  9', '2005-08-16 12:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614570, 214810, 40355, '<td valign="top">I suppose its a difference in artistic style, but I would have liked to seen the chariot and driver a bit better, with less blur.  A bit of blur would still have given it a "traveling through time" feel, if that''s what you were going for, but made it easier to enjoy.  6</td>', 'I suppose its a difference in artistic style, but I would have liked to seen the chariot and driver a bit better, with less blur.  A bit of blur would still have given it a "traveling through time" feel, if that''s what you were going for, but made it easier to enjoy.  6', '2005-08-16 12:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1614575, 214702, 40355, '<td valign="top">So there is water on Mars!!!  lol  Okay, I''ll go along with this, assuming that they''ve terraformed the planet.  (Although it kinda reminds me of the White Cliffs of Dover)  This is neat, a good idea that''s original.  Kudos  7</td>', 'So there is water on Mars!!!  lol  Okay, I''ll go along with this, assuming that they''ve terraformed the planet.  (Although it kinda reminds me of the White Cliffs of Dover)  This is neat, a good idea that''s original.  Kudos  7', '2005-08-16 12:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
