(1615080, 214631, 3087, '<td valign="top">Clever idea to make it look as though the image itself was taken in 1955. I imagine a few folks will be decrying that the content is meant to represent the year not the look of the finish but I kind of like it. On the other hand, content wise it''s the kind of image that is just a family album snapshot - someone''s new car etc. If it were real I might possibly have vague interest as historical record but in 2005? I just can''t find any appeal in the contents OUTSIDE of the fact that it meets the challenge, if that makes sense. What I mean is that if I were giving 5/5 for meeting challenge and 5/5 for appealing to me in it''s own right, I''d give 5 and 1. Goodness but I''m rambling away a la Kavey. I''ll stop now. :o)</td>', 'Clever idea to make it look as though the image itself was taken in 1955. I imagine a few folks will be decrying that the content is meant to represent the year not the look of the finish but I kind of like it. On the other hand, content wise it''s the kind of image that is just a family album snapshot - someone''s new car etc. If it were real I might possibly have vague interest as historical record but in 2005? I just can''t find any appeal in the contents OUTSIDE of the fact that it meets the challenge, if that makes sense. What I mean is that if I were giving 5/5 for meeting challenge and 5/5 for appealing to me in it''s own right, I''d give 5 and 1. Goodness but I''m rambling away a la Kavey. I''ll stop now. :o)', '2005-08-16 17:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
