(1616150, 215966, 37961, '<td valign="top">Pretty.8.</td>', 'Pretty.8.', '2005-08-17 00:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616153, 214125, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - (up from 5 on 2nd view) - For me, a shot of this put into a time capsule would depict a ''way of life'' for this year and era for future generations.  Criticism; whilst it is definitely more of an artistic shot than a ''depiction'', in my opinion, I am wondering if the ''effects'' have detracted from the intended ''era'' ''capture'' for the Challenge, just has more potential to capture the era, in my opinion.  I would like to have seen this cropped to cut out that sign(?) on the left near the water''s edge, but the scenery to the left of that is nice.  As for ''authenticity'' on the house(?) to the right of the windmill (ie the roof) I do not know, so perhaps a cropping out of that as well may have made this a better shot (for the Challenge) in my opiniion.  I do like the b/w(?) effect though and think it adds to the bygone era ''feel'', however, given the seemingly ''simple'' colors that would have been here in color, I wonder how that too would have looked.  Nice shot.</td>', '6 - (up from 5 on 2nd view) - For me, a shot of this put into a time capsule would depict a ''way of life'' for this year and era for future generations.  Criticism; whilst it is definitely more of an artistic shot than a ''depiction'', in my opinion, I am wondering if the ''effects'' have detracted from the intended ''era'' ''capture'' for the Challenge, just has more potential to capture the era, in my opinion.  I would like to have seen this cropped to cut out that sign(?) on the left near the water''s edge, but the scenery to the left of that is nice.  As for ''authenticity'' on the house(?) to the right of the windmill (ie the roof) I do not know, so perhaps a cropping out of that as well may have made this a better shot (for the Challenge) in my opiniion.  I do like the b/w(?) effect though and think it adds to the bygone era ''feel'', however, given the seemingly ''simple'' colors that would have been here in color, I wonder how that too would have looked.  Nice shot.', '2005-08-17 00:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616162, 214675, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 (up from 5) - I think you have a good capture here of this ''era'', a shot of this into a time capsule would depict the era/historical aspect for future generations.  I don''t think the ''AD'' was necessary but that is just my opinion.  Criticism; whilst I think you have captured a certain amount of ''tension'' and ''drama'' here, I would like to see that emphasized somehow.  The colors are nice and bold, especially against the clear blue sky, so depending of course if you were able to incorporate more into the frame, maybe more sky, or full length ''toy soldiers'' (that''s what they look like to me), would have made this a better shot in my opinion.</td>', '6 (up from 5) - I think you have a good capture here of this ''era'', a shot of this into a time capsule would depict the era/historical aspect for future generations.  I don''t think the ''AD'' was necessary but that is just my opinion.  Criticism; whilst I think you have captured a certain amount of ''tension'' and ''drama'' here, I would like to see that emphasized somehow.  The colors are nice and bold, especially against the clear blue sky, so depending of course if you were able to incorporate more into the frame, maybe more sky, or full length ''toy soldiers'' (that''s what they look like to me), would have made this a better shot in my opinion.', '2005-08-17 00:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616167, 216145, 37334, '<td valign="top">This one intigues me...I want to know the story. The man in the framed photo has a face full of character. The man holding the picture is partially hidden by the shadow cast by his hat...but perhaps that was your intention?</td>', 'This one intigues me...I want to know the story. The man in the framed photo has a face full of character. The man holding the picture is partially hidden by the shadow cast by his hat...but perhaps that was your intention?', '2005-08-17 00:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616174, 216030, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - I like the idea for the Challenge, but for me, a shot of this put into a time capsule to depict the era ''for future generations'' wouldn''t quite encapsulate it, in my opinion.  If my presumption is correct, you were going for the ''Madonna thing'', and the glove is fairly authentic to that.  Criticism; I would like to have seen more of the hand (if not a whole ''outfit''/fashion depiction).  The bangles are not ''apt'' in my opinion and the nail polish, not sure.  The photo itself seems to be nice and ''clean'' with a good ''base background'', just doesn''t quite ''sell me'' on the authenticity of this ''era'', just my opinion.  Original though.</td>', '5 - I like the idea for the Challenge, but for me, a shot of this put into a time capsule to depict the era ''for future generations'' wouldn''t quite encapsulate it, in my opinion.  If my presumption is correct, you were going for the ''Madonna thing'', and the glove is fairly authentic to that.  Criticism; I would like to have seen more of the hand (if not a whole ''outfit''/fashion depiction).  The bangles are not ''apt'' in my opinion and the nail polish, not sure.  The photo itself seems to be nice and ''clean'' with a good ''base background'', just doesn''t quite ''sell me'' on the authenticity of this ''era'', just my opinion.  Original though.', '2005-08-17 00:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616177, 214262, 37334, '<td valign="top">Another image that intrigues me. The composition is good and I certainly get a sense of the time period. She''s a lovely doll - I''ve always found dolls like this a little ''spooky'':) Great tones which fit well with the era.</td>', 'Another image that intrigues me. The composition is good and I certainly get a sense of the time period. She''s a lovely doll - I''ve always found dolls like this a little ''spooky'':) Great tones which fit well with the era.', '2005-08-17 00:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616203, 215785, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very nice setup for this still life. The grain is a nice touch as well. Great job!</td>', 'Very nice setup for this still life. The grain is a nice touch as well. Great job!', '2005-08-17 00:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616210, 214959, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Ok, I have to comment on this shot for the potential that I see in it (in my opinion).  Each time I look at it I think the same thing, so I will convey it - though it might be totally against what you were going for.  As far as meeting the Challenge, I think in the sense thtat a shot of this put into a time capsule would not depict this era well for future generations, in my opinion.  The album itself (a classic especially for this year) put into a time capsule, would more so than the photo, just my opinion.  Ok, criticism; I really ''wish'' that the album was ''Saturday Night Fever'' and the guy was dressed up in a ''sharp suit'', doing the ''strut'' style as he walked.  I think that would have made an excellent shot and depicted this era/year very well ''for future generations''.  As it is, I try to ''relate'' the album (Rumours) with the ''set'' you have and the only connection I can make is the slightly ruffled shirt.  Just had to comment on the potential I think this shot had, but it is just my opinion.</td>', '5 - Ok, I have to comment on this shot for the potential that I see in it (in my opinion).  Each time I look at it I think the same thing, so I will convey it - though it might be totally against what you were going for.  As far as meeting the Challenge, I think in the sense thtat a shot of this put into a time capsule would not depict this era well for future generations, in my opinion.  The album itself (a classic especially for this year) put into a time capsule, would more so than the photo, just my opinion.  Ok, criticism; I really ''wish'' that the album was ''Saturday Night Fever'' and the guy was dressed up in a ''sharp suit'', doing the ''strut'' style as he walked.  I think that would have made an excellent shot and depicted this era/year very well ''for future generations''.  As it is, I try to ''relate'' the album (Rumours) with the ''set'' you have and the only connection I can make is the slightly ruffled shirt.  Just had to comment on the potential I think this shot had, but it is just my opinion.', '2005-08-17 00:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1616214, 214575, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Met the Challenge (a photo of this in a time capsule for said year would depict it well for future generations).  Criticism; whilst I do like this shot and the ''era'', I would like to have seen more character incorporated.  You rarely see a color photo of a legionnaire so if you had (were able) to incorporate more of their ''finery'' it would have been much more dramatic in my opinion.  I also like how you didn''t ''explain'' or elaborate on the year, it does say it all if you know a little of history.  Original.  Up to 6 from 5---  Up to 7 last minute look.</td>', '7 - Met the Challenge (a photo of this in a time capsule for said year would depict it well for future generations).  Criticism; whilst I do like this shot and the ''era'', I would like to have seen more character incorporated.  You rarely see a color photo of a legionnaire so if you had (were able) to incorporate more of their ''finery'' it would have been much more dramatic in my opinion.  I also like how you didn''t ''explain'' or elaborate on the year, it does say it all if you know a little of history.  Original.  Up to 6 from 5---  Up to 7 last minute look.', '2005-08-17 00:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
