(1616674, 215792, 11800, '<td valign="top">shhhhh. don''t tell anyone, but cloning isn''t allowed in basic challenges.<br/>The picture is exposed well. The composition, to me, is a bit static, a bit to precise. I guess people were looking for a year, and believe me, they mark down for not meeting the challenge. A large percentage would have marked you down for the border. Borders aren''t generally liked in these parts. Better luck in future challenges.</td>', 'shhhhh. don''t tell anyone, but cloning isn''t allowed in basic challenges.The picture is exposed well. The composition, to me, is a bit static, a bit to precise. I guess people were looking for a year, and believe me, they mark down for not meeting the challenge. A large percentage would have marked you down for the border. Borders aren''t generally liked in these parts. Better luck in future challenges.', '2005-08-17 02:41:09.000000', NULL, 0),
