(1616713, 216205, 22379, '<td valign="top">totally underseved 5.58<br/>i shot this at 11:48:39 (if memory serves me) (its in the EXIF) and didnt get it loaded to my pc until 11:56 which gave me just enough time to crop out my desk that i had no choice to put in the frame due to my artroom being full of crap and it being so last minute, and run it through levels. Its an absolutel miracle it even got submitted because my clock said 12:00 before i hit the submit button but it made it.<br/> <br/>I hate that the base board it broken, that i didnt notice the stupid screwed up polaroid under the chair when i kicked everything out of the way to set down the chair, and the grain. I do think my toepoint is pretty hot though :p</td>', 'totally underseved 5.58i shot this at 11:48:39 (if memory serves me) (its in the EXIF) and didnt get it loaded to my pc until 11:56 which gave me just enough time to crop out my desk that i had no choice to put in the frame due to my artroom being full of crap and it being so last minute, and run it through levels. Its an absolutel miracle it even got submitted because my clock said 12:00 before i hit the submit button but it made it. I hate that the base board it broken, that i didnt notice the stupid screwed up polaroid under the chair when i kicked everything out of the way to set down the chair, and the grain. I do think my toepoint is pretty hot though :p', '2005-08-17 02:53:49.000000', NULL, 0),
