(1616731, 213464, 19952, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by macrothing:</b></div><hr/><i> 5 - This shot has been a bit of a quandry for me to comment on.  It is such a great shot in many ways, the foreground, the teepees(sp?), the differing levels of the mountains, the lighting, the cloud, the mist?, I just wish you had only put the year.  In fact to me, this shot without the title tells other stories before the Lewis &amp; Clark one.  Just my opinion, discard it if you wish, I only comment because it IS a great photo.  But for me, it''s all about the Challenge first.  Ok, up to 5 from 4.  Just in my opinion, if you had just the year, it would leave the viewer ''open'' to interpret it in a variety of ways.  Criticism; maybe a different frame, maybe a little less of the fore, but that does add balance, look in MY opinion, it is an excellent shot, just... that ol'' title business that was part of the description and that ''most'' have adhered to.  Definitely an 8 with just the year. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Huh?</td>', 'Originally posted by macrothing: 5 - This shot has been a bit of a quandry for me to comment on.  It is such a great shot in many ways, the foreground, the teepees(sp?), the differing levels of the mountains, the lighting, the cloud, the mist?, I just wish you had only put the year.  In fact to me, this shot without the title tells other stories before the Lewis & Clark one.  Just my opinion, discard it if you wish, I only comment because it IS a great photo.  But for me, it''s all about the Challenge first.  Ok, up to 5 from 4.  Just in my opinion, if you had just the year, it would leave the viewer ''open'' to interpret it in a variety of ways.  Criticism; maybe a different frame, maybe a little less of the fore, but that does add balance, look in MY opinion, it is an excellent shot, just... that ol'' title business that was part of the description and that ''most'' have adhered to.  Definitely an 8 with just the year.   Huh?', '2005-08-17 03:08:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1616736, 214464, 31214, '<td valign="top">Thanks KaDi....that''s the nicest comment yet!  You made my day (well night).<br/> <br/>This was a fun challenge for me.  My assumption was ...even though he watched the activities on TV the night before, he''s STILL completely in awe and he can''t wait to see more pictures and read about it.<br/> <br/>Glad you liked it and I''m very pleased with the result.</td>', 'Thanks KaDi....that''s the nicest comment yet!  You made my day (well night). This was a fun challenge for me.  My assumption was ...even though he watched the activities on TV the night before, he''s STILL completely in awe and he can''t wait to see more pictures and read about it. Glad you liked it and I''m very pleased with the result.', '2005-08-17 03:15:02.000000', NULL, 0),
