(1616841, 216188, 39141, '<td valign="top">This is a bit discouraging. 50 or so votes at 3 or less, but no comments to tell me why they think it is a ''bad'' photo.<br/>Thank you very, very much to those who did make comments - I''m good at ideas, but a photo obviously needs to have a more universally aesthetic appeal to do well.  I''m learning.<br/> <br/>I think the dpc concept and website is the best ever. Kudos to all of you who keep it going. I''ll be a paid member soon.</td>', 'This is a bit discouraging. 50 or so votes at 3 or less, but no comments to tell me why they think it is a ''bad'' photo.Thank you very, very much to those who did make comments - I''m good at ideas, but a photo obviously needs to have a more universally aesthetic appeal to do well.  I''m learning. I think the dpc concept and website is the best ever. Kudos to all of you who keep it going. I''ll be a paid member soon.', '2005-08-17 04:14:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1616863, 214054, 41337, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bluephoto:</b></div><hr/><i> do not center you main subject please. and don''t cutt his legs. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I have to disagree regarding the centering of the subject. I think it happens to work here just fine. To me it looks like he''s fighting the elements and if he''s off center you lose that cluster phobic feeling.</td>', 'Originally posted by bluephoto: do not center you main subject please. and don''t cutt his legs.  I have to disagree regarding the centering of the subject. I think it happens to work here just fine. To me it looks like he''s fighting the elements and if he''s off center you lose that cluster phobic feeling.', '2005-08-17 04:27:54.000000', NULL, 0),
