(1617723, 215776, 8367, '<td valign="top">Your choice of sepia tone is perfect. Great motion on the props and stop-action on the landing gear. (I certainly hope he''s taking off and not landing...) A great capture! Congratulations on your sale!</td>', 'Your choice of sepia tone is perfect. Great motion on the props and stop-action on the landing gear. (I certainly hope he''s taking off and not landing...) A great capture! Congratulations on your sale!', '2005-08-17 11:16:20.000000', NULL, 0),
