(1620154, 213464, 39430, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote on this challenge, but I saw this shot, and was just blown away.  My first thought was "How is it possible to get a shot like this with one week notice, and no advanced editing?".  I laughed when I saw the photo had already been validated - someone else thought the same thing.<br/> <br/>Awesome shot.  I love everything about it.  Congratulations on the blue ribbon.<br/></td>', 'I didn''t vote on this challenge, but I saw this shot, and was just blown away.  My first thought was "How is it possible to get a shot like this with one week notice, and no advanced editing?".  I laughed when I saw the photo had already been validated - someone else thought the same thing. Awesome shot.  I love everything about it.  Congratulations on the blue ribbon.', '2005-08-18 00:20:44.000000', NULL, 0),
