(1620371, 216188, 36604, '<td valign="top">I suspect the problem was that you forced the voters to read.  Remember, you get only about three seconds from the average viewer, even if you do highlight the exact text they need.  This got a 9 from me at the time, though in protest over the poorly designed challenge description, I didn''t comment on anything.  <br/> <br/>My breakdown:<br/> <br/>Relevance: 5<br/>Technical: +1 (flawless highlighting of "each color is refracted by the prism" across three refracted colors gets you one of my very rare technical bonuses)<br/>Interest: +2<br/>Emotion: +0<br/>Bias: +1 (I like anything that promotes science)<br/></td>', 'I suspect the problem was that you forced the voters to read.  Remember, you get only about three seconds from the average viewer, even if you do highlight the exact text they need.  This got a 9 from me at the time, though in protest over the poorly designed challenge description, I didn''t comment on anything.   My breakdown: Relevance: 5Technical: +1 (flawless highlighting of "each color is refracted by the prism" across three refracted colors gets you one of my very rare technical bonuses)Interest: +2Emotion: +0Bias: +1 (I like anything that promotes science)', '2005-08-18 02:33:05.000000', NULL, 0),
