(1620873, 213464, 20577, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by macrothing:</b></div><hr/><i> 5 - This shot has been a bit of a quandry for me to comment on.  It is such a great shot in many ways, the foreground, the teepees(sp?), the differing levels of the mountains, the lighting, the cloud, the mist?, I just wish you had only put the year.  In fact to me, this shot without the title tells other stories before the Lewis &amp; Clark one.  Just my opinion, discard it if you wish, I only comment because it IS a great photo.  But for me, it''s all about the Challenge first.  Ok, up to 5 from 4.  Just in my opinion, if you had just the year, it would leave the viewer ''open'' to interpret it in a variety of ways.  Criticism; maybe a different frame, maybe a little less of the fore, but that does add balance, look in MY opinion, it is an excellent shot, just... that ol'' title business that was part of the description and that ''most'' have adhered to.  Definitely an 8 with just the year. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I don''t understand how you dropped the score three points because of the title? I know it is YOUR opinion, but that just seems really silly to me. One point I can understand... maybe, but three points? Hmmm....</td>', 'Originally posted by macrothing: 5 - This shot has been a bit of a quandry for me to comment on.  It is such a great shot in many ways, the foreground, the teepees(sp?), the differing levels of the mountains, the lighting, the cloud, the mist?, I just wish you had only put the year.  In fact to me, this shot without the title tells other stories before the Lewis & Clark one.  Just my opinion, discard it if you wish, I only comment because it IS a great photo.  But for me, it''s all about the Challenge first.  Ok, up to 5 from 4.  Just in my opinion, if you had just the year, it would leave the viewer ''open'' to interpret it in a variety of ways.  Criticism; maybe a different frame, maybe a little less of the fore, but that does add balance, look in MY opinion, it is an excellent shot, just... that ol'' title business that was part of the description and that ''most'' have adhered to.  Definitely an 8 with just the year.   I don''t understand how you dropped the score three points because of the title? I know it is YOUR opinion, but that just seems really silly to me. One point I can understand... maybe, but three points? Hmmm....', '2005-08-18 10:01:14.000000', NULL, 0),
