add balance, look in MY opinion, it is an excellent shot, just... that ol'' title business that was part of the description and that ''most'' have adhered to.  Definitely an 8 with just the year.   IS THIS DIGITAL PHOTO CHALLENGE, OR DIGITAL PHOTO TITLE CHALLENGE?  SHOULDN''T WE BE SCORING ON PHOTOGRAPHIC QUALITIES AND MEETING THE CHALLENGE CRITERIA', '2005-08-18 11:39:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(1621297, 215485, 39638, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Evaan:</b></div><hr/><i> I love this one. I''ll be curious to see what you did to make it look like this. Fascinating. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I took it in an aquarium in monterey .. and lightened it up thats it.. if you have been there before you would know exactly what I am talking about... magical exhibit.Really.</td>', 'Originally posted by Evaan: I love this one. I''ll be curious to see what you did to make it look like this. Fascinating.   I took it in an aquarium in monterey .. and lightened it up thats it.. if you have been there before you would know exactly what I am talking about... magical exhibit.Really.', '2005-08-18 13:36:54.000000', NULL, 0),
