(1622090, 215706, 3032, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if many people don''t know art-deco and the preceding jugendstil, it has produced many of the most beautiful buildings of the last century. When you say Empire State or Chrysler building they all know waht you are talking about.<br/>I don''t really understand the low score, it is a fine photo. Had to search and search. :(</td>', 'I don''t know if many people don''t know art-deco and the preceding jugendstil, it has produced many of the most beautiful buildings of the last century. When you say Empire State or Chrysler building they all know waht you are talking about.I don''t really understand the low score, it is a fine photo. Had to search and search. :(', '2005-08-18 19:24:13.000000', NULL, 0),
