(1622149, 215996, 30364, '<td valign="top">Good grief!  I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I am dismayed at the number of commentators who obviously feel that the ''blown'' portions of this image (and any image, I suspect) are by definition ''bad photography''.  Of course, people are entitled to be narrow-minded.  But surely they should at least have the wit to recognise that the photographer clearly intended the effect in this case, and isn''t now sitting reading their comments, slapping her forehead and saying, "What was I thinking ... how could I have missed that?".</td>', 'Good grief!  I didn''t vote in this challenge, but I am dismayed at the number of commentators who obviously feel that the ''blown'' portions of this image (and any image, I suspect) are by definition ''bad photography''.  Of course, people are entitled to be narrow-minded.  But surely they should at least have the wit to recognise that the photographer clearly intended the effect in this case, and isn''t now sitting reading their comments, slapping her forehead and saying, "What was I thinking ... how could I have missed that?".', '2005-08-18 19:59:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1622423, 213464, 12809, '<td valign="top">I think this is fantastic and probably would have given it a 9.  As for the title, I can see why you used it for the challenge (as somewhat of an explanation to the viewers), but I think (as said below) that no title or just the year would be more mysterious too.  I certainly wouldn''t dock you 3 points for the title though. :-)  This is so beautiful.</td>', 'I think this is fantastic and probably would have given it a 9.  As for the title, I can see why you used it for the challenge (as somewhat of an explanation to the viewers), but I think (as said below) that no title or just the year would be more mysterious too.  I certainly wouldn''t dock you 3 points for the title though. :-)  This is so beautiful.', '2005-08-18 21:39:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1622508, 214959, 26189, '<td valign="top">Being a FM fan I can only comment on how well you captured the shot.  The black and white makes it look classic.  I love it!!</td>', 'Being a FM fan I can only comment on how well you captured the shot.  The black and white makes it look classic.  I love it!!', '2005-08-18 22:25:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(1623299, 216098, 18932, '<td valign="top">A little bit too cluttered, and the highlights are a bit too bright, but despite that, this has a nostalgic feel fitting for the challenge. The grain helps this, though maybe a little too strong.</td>', 'A little bit too cluttered, and the highlights are a bit too bright, but despite that, this has a nostalgic feel fitting for the challenge. The grain helps this, though maybe a little too strong.', '2005-08-19 07:15:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1623434, 214156, 30049, '<td valign="top">IMO the photo is ok. I remember being overwhelmed the first time I saw it...it''s very "busy". Some creative lighting may have given this a boost. For this to work we didn''t need to see all of the details on every game cartridge. Just needed to know what they were. Maybe a low angled light that lit up the Mario game and some cartridges diagonally, then let the rest fall into shadows?</td>', 'IMO the photo is ok. I remember being overwhelmed the first time I saw it...it''s very "busy". Some creative lighting may have given this a boost. For this to work we didn''t need to see all of the details on every game cartridge. Just needed to know what they were. Maybe a low angled light that lit up the Mario game and some cartridges diagonally, then let the rest fall into shadows?', '2005-08-19 09:29:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1623980, 215399, 14773, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by goodman:</b></div><hr/><i> can yu play tennis?<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=219079" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/16241/thumb/219079.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/16241/thumb/219079.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/16241/thumb/219079.jpg"/></a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>be still my heart...<br/> <br/>..and nice shot Joe..is that you? It''s not so obvious (with the coke, not the trophy I mean).</td>', 'Originally posted by goodman: can yu play tennis?    be still my heart... ..and nice shot Joe..is that you? It''s not so obvious (with the coke, not the trophy I mean).', '2005-08-19 14:08:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1623990, 215399, 25397, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GoldBerry:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/>..and nice shot Joe..is that you? It''s not so obvious (with the coke, not the trophy I mean). </i></td></tr></table> <br/>yes it is me with my hair slicked back- something I don''t do very often. (ew)</td>', 'Originally posted by GoldBerry: ..and nice shot Joe..is that you? It''s not so obvious (with the coke, not the trophy I mean).  yes it is me with my hair slicked back- something I don''t do very often. (ew)', '2005-08-19 14:14:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1624044, 215425, 3032, '<td valign="top">Thanks all, didn''t expect this at all. You made me very happy. :)<br/> <br/>About the angle this is shot at (why not more attention to the steam at both sides): There is a modern big and ugly industrial area right behind the train. The train hides it all. An angle to include more of the steam would also have shown that area.</td>', 'Thanks all, didn''t expect this at all. You made me very happy. :) About the angle this is shot at (why not more attention to the steam at both sides): There is a modern big and ugly industrial area right behind the train. The train hides it all. An angle to include more of the steam would also have shown that area.', '2005-08-19 14:46:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1624469, 216212, 41444, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dahved:</b></div><hr/><i> Is this one of those souvenir picture viewers you might get at an amusement park? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes, it is.<br/>But i,ve uploaded the wrong shot. Very very hard to understand.</td>', 'Originally posted by dahved: Is this one of those souvenir picture viewers you might get at an amusement park?   Yes, it is.But i,ve uploaded the wrong shot. Very very hard to understand.', '2005-08-19 18:25:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1624491, 214156, 19672, '<td valign="top">Part of the problem with the photo is the harsh "flash" noticeable on certain cartridges (OMG took me a second to remember what those are called) combined with shadows that make other cartridge titles difficult to see.</td>', 'Part of the problem with the photo is the harsh "flash" noticeable on certain cartridges (OMG took me a second to remember what those are called) combined with shadows that make other cartridge titles difficult to see.', '2005-08-19 18:38:44.000000', NULL, 0),
