(1626228, 216060, 41310, '<td valign="top">Once again in Santa Barbara, if u live there can u tell me on my next pic revue. cuz i live there to (well closer to Goleta)</td>', 'Once again in Santa Barbara, if u live there can u tell me on my next pic revue. cuz i live there to (well closer to Goleta)', '2005-08-20 13:51:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1626508, 215977, 37673, '<td valign="top">This fits the challenge very nicely.  The pictures looks like an authentic antique photo. You did well with the sepia and tones. The focus isn''t too sharp which would have been so in this era and really lends itself to the photo. The paper is a bit too white though. It should have been a little dirtier and yellow to fit better. The composition is a bit dull. It doesn''t pop out or have any character. It could have been just a bit lighter. But, that adds to the antique look. overall I think you did very well. I would like to know where you managed to find a typewriter in this day and age?  Very nicely done.</td>', 'This fits the challenge very nicely.  The pictures looks like an authentic antique photo. You did well with the sepia and tones. The focus isn''t too sharp which would have been so in this era and really lends itself to the photo. The paper is a bit too white though. It should have been a little dirtier and yellow to fit better. The composition is a bit dull. It doesn''t pop out or have any character. It could have been just a bit lighter. But, that adds to the antique look. overall I think you did very well. I would like to know where you managed to find a typewriter in this day and age?  Very nicely done.', '2005-08-20 16:48:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1626555, 215996, 7743, '<td valign="top">This image would make a very good high key image and has a good start to that end.  However, I believe the transition between bright and dark areas of the image is way too harsh giving it the feel of overexposed rather than high key.<br/> <br/>IMO, for high key to work all important detail should still be present with a nice even flow from bright to dark kind of like fading.</td>', 'This image would make a very good high key image and has a good start to that end.  However, I believe the transition between bright and dark areas of the image is way too harsh giving it the feel of overexposed rather than high key. IMO, for high key to work all important detail should still be present with a nice even flow from bright to dark kind of like fading.', '2005-08-20 17:03:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1626930, 215134, 39243, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great shot that did not meet the challenge. I see that this is your first entry and I have a feeling you will do well once you get the hang of this site. I try only to enter the competitions I have an appropriate photo for. I am not a great photographer but I think that your photo would have done better in another challenge. Good luck.<br/> <br/>Steve</td>', 'I think this is a great shot that did not meet the challenge. I see that this is your first entry and I have a feeling you will do well once you get the hang of this site. I try only to enter the competitions I have an appropriate photo for. I am not a great photographer but I think that your photo would have done better in another challenge. Good luck. Steve', '2005-08-20 20:46:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1627095, 215957, 27133, '<td valign="top">Kel...I never saw this one during the challenge so didn''t vote on it.  But I have to say, I think this is one of your best.<br/> <br/>Judi</td>', 'Kel...I never saw this one during the challenge so didn''t vote on it.  But I have to say, I think this is one of your best. Judi', '2005-08-20 22:15:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(1627185, 215957, 27812, '<td valign="top">AHHHHH! Beautiful.</td>', 'AHHHHH! Beautiful.', '2005-08-20 23:18:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(1627251, 215399, 12253, '<td valign="top">Congrat''s on your top 10 entry Joey.  Looks like you are doing well with the new camera--nice shot!</td>', 'Congrat''s on your top 10 entry Joey.  Looks like you are doing well with the new camera--nice shot!', '2005-08-20 23:47:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1627383, 213464, 12253, '<td valign="top">Superb shot!  What a beautiful scene.  Congratulations!</td>', 'Superb shot!  What a beautiful scene.  Congratulations!', '2005-08-21 01:20:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1627385, 215425, 12253, '<td valign="top">Curious about the museum aspect of this.  Are the people real?  They look real!  Well done and congratulations!</td>', 'Curious about the museum aspect of this.  Are the people real?  They look real!  Well done and congratulations!', '2005-08-21 01:21:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1627642, 215425, 3032, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nshapiro:</b></div><hr/><i> Curious about the museum aspect of this.  Are the people real?  They look real!  Well done and congratulations! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yep, they are real. This was shot at Wognum trainstation. In the summer some people dress up and load stuff on and off the train for example. Also some people on the train are actors. The main musuem is in Hoorn, but they don''t dress up there. In Hoorn you can look at the app. 10 trains they have.<br/>I''m not sure if they have an actor on all trains. This is the most favorite locomotive and it runs on special days and in the summer. These carts are the oldest and most authentic as well.</td>', 'Originally posted by nshapiro: Curious about the museum aspect of this.  Are the people real?  They look real!  Well done and congratulations!   Yep, they are real. This was shot at Wognum trainstation. In the summer some people dress up and load stuff on and off the train for example. Also some people on the train are actors. The main musuem is in Hoorn, but they don''t dress up there. In Hoorn you can look at the app. 10 trains they have.I''m not sure if they have an actor on all trains. This is the most favorite locomotive and it runs on special days and in the summer. These carts are the oldest and most authentic as well.', '2005-08-21 07:09:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1628130, 214054, 1897, '<td valign="top">The elements that are negative from a compisition stand-point really make the photo for me, good job.</td>', 'The elements that are negative from a compisition stand-point really make the photo for me, good job.', '2005-08-21 14:43:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(1628470, 214974, 38149, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture - I''m surprised it didn''t do better in the challenge.  I didn''t vote on this challenge but I would have given it a 7. I would have probably cropped it a bit larger to get a bit more of the record player in bu the black and white works just fine.</td>', 'This is a nice picture - I''m surprised it didn''t do better in the challenge.  I didn''t vote on this challenge but I would have given it a 7. I would have probably cropped it a bit larger to get a bit more of the record player in bu the black and white works just fine.', '2005-08-21 17:43:32.000000', NULL, 0),
